<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="h">MAREKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Evangeli thza Mareka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mareka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar</para>
  <para style="mt2">Evangeli thza</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mareka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CC, HS, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa ya Johani Mukwakukorovethza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Joh 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Matatekero o Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Yesu Krisitu Mwana Nyambi po aa: <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Eci edi ku na ñoriwa mu vuka thza mukwakukethza Isaya ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Kenge na ku tuma kanganda kange ku rupara rwoe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">oyu wa ku ka roithsa dikuñwa dyoe.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Diywi dyoyu kuerera mu dikunguthsitu dya amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Mu roithse mukwakwa wa Fumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">mu orore makuñwa enthzi!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Johani ngou a monaharire mu dikunguthsitu no ku korovethza anu no ku honga ci: “Mu cere evi yenu no ku korovethziwa, ci evi i teteriwe.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Ditunga dya Judea dyodihe no thsikuña thsa Yerusalema thsothsihe a thzire ku kwenthzi. A citawerire evi yo, Johani ngou a wa korovethzire mu Rware rwa Jorodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Johani shime a vatangire thsikoveyo thso ku ruka pohunga o kamere, no ku cianga mwiya o thsitumba mu mbunda. Wa dyangire thsetuthsetu noki.<verse eid="MRK 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Wa hongire ci: “Aa keya munyima thzange o mukoro kupita ame, ka ni roerire shaanga ku kotama ku putura tuangithso to mashangu enthzi. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ame naa mi korovethza ko meyu, unone aye kenge a ku na mi korovethza ko Mupepo Oukenu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Korovethzo neereka ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mat 3.13—4.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Mwethso thsikati Yesu wa tundire ku Nazareta mbongi thzo mu Galilea. Johani wa na mu korovethzire mu Rware rwa Jorodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Yesu o ku womboka mu meyu, popo wa monine diwiru o ku di yanthzuruka, no Mupepo o ku u shurumukera pa penthzi eci dikuci. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Ngou kwa tundire diywi ku wiru ci: “Yowe o Mwanange oyu na shima no ku ni roerithsa nene.” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus Tempted in the wilderness" file="wa03812b.tif" size="col" loc="Mrk 1:12-13" copy="Wade" ref="1.12-13">Yesu aa erekiwa mu dikunguthsitu</figure><verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Popo Mupepo wa mu twarire mu dikunguthsitu, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />oku a ka mu tumawerire Satana mayuwa o makumi ane. Wa kekarire nekondwama yo mu murundu, karo tungeru twa mu kwamenine.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aethsa erongwa yo kutanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat 4.12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Munyima thzo kupakiwa kwa Johani mu kamenga, Yesu wa thzire mu Galilea o ku thza o honga Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Nyambi. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Wa ambire ci: “Thsikati ethsi a kumbwethzire Nyambi thsi na kumu, no Kutumina kwa Nyambi pepi ku di. Mu cere evi yenu no ku tawa Muthzimbu Ouwa!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Diyuwa dimweya Yesu o ku thza o enda ku mukenga o Diviya dya Galilea, wa monine Simoni na Andereasi minenthzi o kwa konthzera dituwa mu Diviya dya Galilea, inene nedi eyambi yothsi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Mu keye mu ni shupwere na ni mi rongithse ku yamba anu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Popo a thsiire matuwa o no ku mu shupwera.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Ou a endireko kamanana, wa monine Jakovo na minenthzi Johani ana Zebedea, o kwa honga matuwa o mu wato. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Popo Yesu wa wethsire, awo a thsiire tata wo Zebedea mu wato nakwerume amweya awa a kumunine, no ku shupwera Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa o mupepo oumango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4.31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu nerongwa yenthzi a thzire mu mbongi thza Kapenauma. Ou dya vire dyo Savata, Yesu wa kengenine mu sinagoge no ku tateka ku rongithsa. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Anu a komokire kerongithsa yenthzi, inene shime a rongithsire kokoro, kadi eci arongithsi o murao.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Popo omo mu sinagoge thzo kwengenine mukwerume oyu wekarire no mupepo oumango. Wa kumbire ci: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Yesu wa Nazareta, ine eyi o fota ku kwetu? Ene waa keyera ku na tu thzirithsa nji? Ni na ku dimuka, yowe O Shokenu wa Nyambi!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu wa u kutururire ci: “O tutware! O tunde ku kwenthzi!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Uya mupepo oumango ngou wa mu tukukithsire kokoro, no ku tunda ku kwenthzi ko ku karumuka nene.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Anu wahe awa ekarire apo a komokire no ku cipaura ci: “Ine eyi? Erongithsa yoipe kokoro! Aa tumina shaanga mipepo thzothzimango, karo thzaa mu yuvera.” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Muthzimbu keyi ya Yesu wa yukire ko wanguwangu mu mandau oahe a Galilea.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa akwakukora owangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Yesu ou a punine mu sinagoge, wa thzire na Jakovo na Johani ku nthzio thza Simoni na Andereasi. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Ngumwenya Simoni shime a rarire o ku kora dihokoma. Popo a tongwerire Yesu keyi yenthzi. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Aye wa thzire ku kwenthzi no ku ka mu kwata ku dyoko ku mu kwathsa ci a katuke. Dihokoma dya mu pwire, ayepo tateka ku wa kwamena yo ku dya.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Runguro diyuwa o ku di na toko, anu a retire kwa Yesu akwakukora wahe, nakwamathzimu. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Anu wahe omo mu mbongi, ongumanine pa thsero. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu wa porithsire anu owangi wekora yo mishovoshovo, karo wa cithzire mathzimu oangi. Unone wa kanithsire mathzimu ku amba thsimweya, inene a mu dimukire ci yodiyo edye.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa rongithsa mu Galilea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Mu ruura diyuwa o ku di shime ku va, Yesu wa pindukire no ku thza mu dikunguthsitu ku ka rombera. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Munyima Simoni naenthzenthzi a thzire o mu fota. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Ou a ka mu wanine a ka mu amberire ci: “Anu wahe aa ku fota.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Twaa roera ku thza no ku mambongi amweya ku ka honga, inene yodiyo na ni keyera.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Ngou a thzire mu ditunga dyodihe dya Galilea, o ku thza o honga mu masinagoge o, no ku cithza mathzimu.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa munu wengondwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Diyuwa dimweya munu wengondwe wa keyire ku na tongama ku rupara rwa Yesu, no ku mu adikanena ci: “Nga o i shime kenge nga o ni porithsa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Ko ku yuva ñekeñeke, Yesu wa ororire dyoko ku mu kwata no ku amba ci: “Ni na i shimi, o pore!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Popo engondwe ya pwire wa porire. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci a thze, unone wa mu koñomekire ku mu raerera ci: <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“O teerere! Katere o i tongwere munu eyi, o thze kwa mupurisita a ka ku mone. O ka punithse thsikunda thso kukenithsiwa koe, eci edi a i raererire Mushe ci ikare ombangi kwanu wahe.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Unone aye wa thzire o tongora kokuhe oku a pitire keyi ya tendaharire ku kwenthzi. Mukaci keyo, Yesu ka a twethsire karo kwingena mu mambongi ko ku cimonaharithsa. Unone shime ekarangire pohuma kokumengi. Shaanga kengeyo anu a keyangire ku kwenthzi ku tunda mu mandau oahe.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa o ku ara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Munyima thzo mayuwa oapu, Yesu wa hukire ku Kapenauma, anu a yuvire ci ku nthzio a di. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />A ka ciwanawanineko kongi, nthzio thza yarire ku ninga ci mane ka kwekarire karo dipenga shaanga pora thzo thsero. Yesu ngou a wa rongithsire diywi dya Nyambi. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Kwa keyire akwerume ane awa mu reterire munu o ku ara oyu a tengire pa kanaha. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Mukaci kongi anu, a kwangire dyo ku mu kumithsa kwa Yesu. Ngou a thzinine pa thsituwa no ku tuyura dicumbwa ku twarikethza apa ekarire Yesu. Ou a manine ku tuyura, a shurumweninemo oyo mukwerume o kuara o ku na rara pa kanaha. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu ou a monine thsitawo thso, wa amberire oyo mukwerume o kuara ci: “Mwanange, evi yoe i na teteriwa.” <figure style="fig" alt="Mat lowered through the ceiling" file="lb00305b.tif" size="col" loc="Mrk 2:1-5" copy="Bass Knowles" ref="2.1-5">Kanaha kaa shurumweniwa peuru thzo thsituwa</figure><verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Unone arongithsi amweya o murao awa ekariremo a anekerire mu micima ci: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Ine eyi a ambera kenge oyu? Aa yengwa! Edye o ku twethsa ku tetera evi, ngeci kadi shime Nyambi pohuma?”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Ko wanguwangu Yesu wa dimukire mu mucima wenthzi eanekera yo, ngou a wa amberire ci: “Ine eyi mu anekerera yo kengeyo mu micima thzenu?” <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />“Thsothsioto ne thsipi, ku ambera oyu mukwerume o kuara ci: ‘Evi yoe i na teteriwa,’ nji ku amba ci: ‘O katuke, o shimbe kanaha koe, o ende?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Pano honi kenge ni mi monithsa ci Mwana Munu o di nokoro o ku tetera evi mu kaye!” Wa amberire oyo mukwerume o kuara ci: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“O katuke, o shimbe kanaha koe o thze ku diumbo!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Popo wa katukire no ku shimba kanaha kenthzi no ku thza, anu wahe o kwa na tanekera. Anu wahe a komokire nene no ku shangara Nyambi ci: “Twa diyerire ku mona enu yo kenge!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aethsa Livi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu wa hukire karo ku kakuro ka Galilea. Anu owangi a keyire ku kwenthzi, ngou a tatekire ku wa rongithsa. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Mu dikuñwa wa monine Livi mwana Alufea o ku nekara mu ofithsi thzo mutero. Wa mu amberire ci: “O ni shupwere!” Livi wa katukire no ku mu shupwera.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Munyima thzeyo, Yesu wa thzire ku nthzio thza Livi. O ku nekara ku tafure mu nthzio, kwekarire aterithsi owangi nanu wevi awa a na dire nenthzi nerongwa yenthzi, inene anu owangi a mu shupwerire. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Arongithsi amweya o murao o mu thsikwata thsAfarithsi ou a monine Yesu o ku dya nanu wevi naterithsi, epurire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Ine eyi a dyera naterithsi nanu wevi?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu ou a yuvire eyi, wa wa amberire ci: “Awa a di nawa mwirama tumba a foto mukwakupanga, unone shime awa a kora.” Ka na ni keyera ku nethsa owawawa, unone ku nethsa anu wevi.<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anu aepura Yesu yo ku cikanga no nthzara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Diyuwa dimweya, erongwa ya Johani Mukwakukorovethza nAfarithsi o kwa cikanga no nthzara, anu amweya a keyire ku nepura Yesu ci: “Ine erongwa ya Johani mukwakukorovethza neyi yAfarithsi eyi i na cikangeranga no nthzara, unone erongwa yoe ayo ka i cikangangire no nthzara?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Ngepi nga a cikanga no nthzara awa a na raiwa, mukwakuyeka o ku dino? Dyombo! Tumba a tende kengeyo aye oku dino. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Uno honi thsikati kenge thsa ku keya mukwakuyeka ou a ku tundithsiwa kukwo. Mwedyo diyuwa honi kenge a ku cikanga no nthzara.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Kwithsa munu oyu nga fumena thsikamba thsothsipe pa thsikoveyo thsothsikurukuru. Ngeci ayepo tenda kengeyo, thsikamba thsothsipe kenge thsi yatura thsikoveyo thsothsikurukuru, dicumbwa kenge dikara dyodikuru kupita pa kutanga. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Karo kwithsa munu o ku rongera waine omupe mu tuhupa totukurukuru. Ngeci ayepo tenda kengeyo, waine omupe kenge a yatura tuhupa, mweyo, tuhupa no waine kenge ipa yoihe. Dyombo, waine omupe aa roera ku rongeriwa mu tuhupa totupe.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu po Fumu o diyuwa dyo Savata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Diyuwa dimweya dyo Savata Yesu wa pitire mu makanda. Mu dikuñwa, erongwa yenthzi ya tatekire ku cora mashakara o mahangu. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Afarithsi a mu amberire ci: “O mone, ine eyi i tendera eyi i na kana ku tawethziwa mu diyuwa dyo Savata?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Ene ka mwa tara eyi a tendire Davida diyuwa dimweya ou a fire nthzara nowa a endire nenthzi?” <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Wengenine mu nthzio thza Nyambi nowa a endire nenthzi, no ku ka dya ku makende aa a tupwerire Nyambi, aa a tawethziwire ku diwa pohuma ku mapurisita. Eyi shime ya tendaharire Abiatare o ku di mupurisita shokuru.<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Ngou honi Yesu a wa amberire ci: “Dyo Savata po shime dya kwamiwerire munu, kadi munu ku kwamiwera dyo Savata. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Mweyo, Mwana Munu po Fumu shaanga o diyuwa dyo Savata.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa mukwerume o ku kukutera dyoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Diyuwa dimweya Yesu wa thzire karo mu sinagoge, omo kwekarire munu o ku kukutera dyoko. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Pakuninga ci nedi diyuwa dyo Savata, anu a rungamenine ci a mone Yesu o ku porithsa munu, ci nga a mu shangethze eamba mukaci ko ku kwama dyo Savata.<verse eid="MRK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu wa amberire oya munu o ku kukutera dyoko ci: “O keye no wimane ku rupara rwanu wahe.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Ngou epurire mbunga ci: “Ethsi thsi na tawethziwa mu murao o diyuwa dyo Savata ne thsipi? Ku tenda yoiwa nji ku tenda yoimango? Ku yoyithsa munu nji kwipaa?” Unone kwithsa oyu wa mu tawire thsimweya.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Wa wa tanekerire koanthzi no thsinyengo nene, mukaci ko mukanayuva o micima thzo. Ngou a amberire oyo mukwerume ci: “O orore dyoko dyoe!” Wa ororire dyoko dyenthzi, popo dya porire. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Afarithsi ngou a tundire mu sinagoge no ku ka ciwana no thsipani thsa Heroda ku ceka dyo kwipaa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbunga thzaa shupwera Yesu</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu nerongwa yenthzi ngou a tundire kwanu no ku thza ku Diviya dya Galilea, mbunga thzothzikuru thza mu shupwerire ku tunda ku Galilea na Judea. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Amweya shime tundire ku Yerusalema, no ku Idumea, nakwa thsambwadiya thza Jorodani, nakwa matunga o pepi na Tire na Sidoni. Wahe a keyire kwa Yesu pa ku yuva yoihe eyi a kwamine.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus preaches to the crowd from a boat" file="lb00299b.tif" size="span" loc="Mrk 3:9-12" copy="Knowles" ref="3.9-12">Yesu aa rongithsa anu o ku di mu wato</figure><verse eid="MRK 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Mukaci ko mbunga ongi, wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci a mu roithsereko wato ci mbunga katere thzi mu thsindakane. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Pakuninga ci shime a porithsire anu owangi, akwakukora wahe a cithsinenekethzire ku kwenthzi ci nga a mu kwate. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Akwamathzimu ou a mu monine, a wererire pa rupara rwenthzi no ku kumba ci: “Yowe o Mwana Nyambi.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Unone aye wa thzi kanithsire nene ci thza mu tongora kwanu.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa hangura tunganda to dikumi na twidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Munyima thzeyo Yesu wa thzire ku mukinya, wethsire awa a fotire ci a thze nenthzi, a keyire ku kwenthzi. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Wa hangurire o dikumi naidi no ku wa ta ci tunganda, ci nga ekare nenthzi karo ci nga a wa tumange ku ka honga, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />no ku wa pa okoro o ku cithza mathzimu. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Awa a hangurire po awa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:16">Simoni oyu a tire ci Peturu,<verse eid="MRK 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Jakovo na minenthzi Johani ana Zebedea awa a tire ci Bonagesi, ku amba ci Ana Mushika.<verse eid="MRK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andereasi na Filipu, na Batolomeu, na Mateu, na Tomasi, Jakovo mwana Alufea, na Tadea, na Simoni Zeloti, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />no Judasi Isikariota oyu wa mu ombire.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Beelezebule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12.22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Yesu ngou engenine mu nthzio, karo mbunga thza ciwanine kuninga ci Yesu nerongwa yenthzi a pirire shaanga thsikati thso ku dya. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Apenthzi ou a i yuvire, a keyireko ci na mu shimbe pakuninga ci shime a ambire ci: “Na thzaruka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Arongithsi o murao awa tundire ku Yerusalema a ambire ci: “O di nokoro wa ñathsire o mathzimu oyu nethsiwa Beelezebule aye Satana! Kodiyo oku a wana okoro o ku cithza mathzimu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yesu ngou a wethsire no ku wa tera tuthsimo ci: “Satana ne ngepi edi nga a cithza Satana? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ngeci kutumina kwaa cia ko ku cirwithsa kothsinda, oko kutumina tumba ku tanara. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Mofoci nakwa mwanda ofoci o kwikareranga ku cirwithsa, oo mwanda tumba u tanara. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ngeci Satana aa cirwithsa thsinda no ku cia, tumba a tanara, unone kupwa kwenthzi ku na kumu. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Unone kwithsa munu o ku twethsa kwingena mu nthzio thzo ndwarume ku mwithzera etere yenthzi, shime a tange tango ku mwanga mbeci nga a twethse ku i shimba.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci evi yoihe no kuyengwera kokuhe kwanu kenge ya ku teteriwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Unone yomuhe o ku yengwera Mupepo Oukenu mbera ka a teteriwa, ethso po thsivi thso diyere.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu wa ambire eyi pakuninga ci anu amweya shime ambire ci: “Wa mupepo oumango.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amina Yesu na mama wo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Amina Yesu na mama wo a na kumine ci na mu mone. Emanine pora no ku tuma munu ku ka mwithsa. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Mbunga thzekarire ku thzingwera Yesu, munu yumweya wa mu amberire ci: “Mama woe naminoe aa ku fota pora.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Mama naminange ne adye?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Ngou a tanekerire anu wahe awa a mu thzingwerire no ku amba ci: “Mu na mono, awa wodiyo amama naminange. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Inene yomuhe o ku kwama eshima ya Nyambi, yodiyo minange no ndumbuthzange no mama.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko mbuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Karo Yesu wa tatekire ku rongithsa ku nganga thzo Diviya dya Galilea. Mbunga thzothzikuru nene thza mu thzingwerire, mweyo wa yomamine mu wato. Ngou a kekariremo pa diviya ku thsia mbunga thzothzihe pa dikambo. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Shime a wa rongithsire enu yoingi ko tuthsimo. Mu ku wa rongithsa kwenthzi, wa wa amberire ci:<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Mu teerere! Njimi wa thzire ku ka kuna mbuto thzenthzi. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />O ku kuhera mbuto, thzimweya thza wererire mu dikuñwa, enyunyi ya keyire ku na thzi dya. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Thzimweya mbuto thza wererire pa ndau thzo mawe apa thza kanine ku wana muve oungi. Thza menine ko wanguwangu, inene ka pekarire muve oungi. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Unone ou wa twire mutenya, shongo thza rerire no ku kukuta, inene ka thza henyine mithzithzi. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Thzimweya mbuto thza wererire mu makona, makona ou a kurire a thzi nthzongonokithsire, thza kwangire ku pateka. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Thzimweya mbuto thza wererire mu muve o wiro. Thza menine no ku kura, thza shemine no ku wana oheke oungi. Thzimweya makumi ahatu pa dishushu, thzimweya makumi mutanu na dyofoci, ethzi thzimweya makumi dikumi.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Oyu di no matwi o ku yuvithsa a yuve.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tongonona yo tuthsimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Yesu ou a thsiarire yofoci, tunganda twenthzi to dikumi na twidi nerongwa imweya, ya mu rombire ci a wa tongonwenene oto tuthsimo.<verse eid="MRK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Wa i amberire ci: “Amwe po na mu piwa ku yuvithsithsa diano dyo Kutumina kwa Nyambi. Unone kowa nathsara, enu yoihe yaa ambiwa kukwo ko tuthsimo ci:<verse eid="MRK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />“‘Shaanga wowa a mona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">kadi akwa ku monenena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">shaanga wowa a yuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">kadi akwa ku yuvithsithsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">ci katere a piruke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">no ku teteriwa mirandu thzo.’”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tongonona kathsimo ko mukwakukuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Yesu ngou a wa amberire ci: “Ngeci mwaa kwanga ku yuvithsithsa a ka kathsimo ne, ngepi nga mu yuvithsithsa tuthsimo tumweya? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Oya njimi po muhongi o diywi dya Nyambi. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Anu amweya aa cipitura eci mbuto ethzi thza wererire mu dikuñwa. Aa yuva diywi dya Nyambi, unone Satana aa keya no ku na di tundithsa mu micima thzo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Amweya aa cipitura no mbuto ethzi thza wererire mu muve o mawe, aa yuva diywi dya Nyambi no ku di tambura ko thsinyanyu ko wanguwangu. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Unone pakuninga ci ka di no mithzithzi nawa, aa citanarithsa thsikati thsothsipu. Ekarupa nji makando yoihe i keya mukaci ko diywi dya Nyambi aa wa ko wanguwangu. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Amweya karo aa cipitura eci mbuto ethzi thza wererire mu makona. Aa yuva diywi dya Nyambi, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />uno honi mukaci kecoyoka yo uno mwoyo no ku yemburuka mu rufumo no ku cikumbwethza enu imweya, diywi dyaa nthzongonoka kadi dya ku pateka. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Amweya aa cipitura eci mbuto thzo pa muve o wiro, aa yuva diywi no ku di tambura, aa shema no ku wana oheke oungi. Thzimweya makumi ahatu pa dishushu, thzimweya makumi mutanu na dyofoci, thzimweya makumi o dikumi, ku piterera eyi ya kuniwire.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko kambarambara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8.16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Ene kenge nga o reta kambarambara mu nthzio no ku ka furumeka kafuma, nji ku ka paka mushi thzodidi? Ene nga ko ka kureka pa thsimeko thsako? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Mweyo, yoihe eyi i na horekiwa kenge ya ku hokoriwa, neyi i na thzindiwa kenge mba i keya mu mwethzi no ku dimukiwa kwanu wahe. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Yomuhe oyu di no matwi a yuve.”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu wa wa amberire karo ci: “Mu teerere nawa no ku pakera maano kweyi mu yuva! Thsothsi thsianekethzithso mu cikwathsithsa, thsothsa ku cikwathsithsiwa ku kwenu mane kupita omu mu kwamena. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Yomuhe oyu di nethsi thsimweya kenge a ku vungithsiwera, unone oyu na piri kenge a ku nyangiwa noka kokapu a di nako.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko mbuto ethzi thzi kura</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu wa ambire karo ci: “Kutumina kwa Nyambi kwaa cipitura no mbuto ethzi a kuwire munu pa muve. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Othsiku no mutenya, o ku na rara nji o ku kenga, mbuto thzaa mena no ku kura aye kokukana ku dimuka. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Muve ao othsinda odiyo u na menithsanga vuroto. Thso kutanga muthsithsi, mbeci ku keye dishakara, mbeci honi nona thzi kore mu dishakara. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Nona yoihe thzi kora, popo njimi aa shimba cekithsi ku yanga, inene thsikati thso ku yanga thsi na kumu.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko dinanda dyotata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13.31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu karo wa ambire ci: “No thsine nga tu ku piturithsa Kutumina kwa Nyambi? Nji kathsimo mwine nga tu cikwathsithsa ku ku tongonona? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Kwaa cipitura no dinanda dyotata edi di na kuniwa mu muve. Dyodiyo dinanda dyo dionye kupita nanda thzothzihe mu kaye. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Unone o ku di na kuniwa, dyaa kura kupita ekuniwa yoihe kukuru no kwikara no mite thzothzikuru ci shaanga enyunyi yaa na yarako mataratara mu mumvure wadyo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu wa rongithsangire ko tuthsimo to ku cipitura eci otu ci anu a twethse ku yuvithsithsa. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Ka a ambangireno ko kukana ku cikwathsithsa tuthsimo. Unone o ku di yofoci nerongwa yenthzi, wa i tongonwenangire enu yoihe.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tutwarithsa dyungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Edyo diyuwa runguro, Yesu wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Tu yavukerenu mu thsambwadiya thzo diviya.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />A thsiire mbunga thzothzihe, a yomamine mu wato na Yesu no ku hunyuna. Kwekarire mato amweya aa a yavukerire pofoci na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Kwa keyire dyungu dyodikuru nene no mañithsingi a furire pa wato ku ninga ci mane shime waa fota ku rowera.<verse eid="MRK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu aye shime a rarire ku dihuto dyo kunyima o ku na thsatera pa muthsato, erongwa ya mu pindurire no ku mu ambera ci: “Ñathsire wetu, ene ka i ku korithsire ku mucima ci twaa fa?”<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus calms the storm" file="gt00049b.tif" size="col" loc="Mrk 4:35-41" copy="Gordon" ref="4.35-41">Yesu aa tutwarithsa dyungu</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Wa pindukire no ku kuturura dyungu no ku ambera mañithsingi ci: “O tutware! O onge!” Dyungu dya tutwarire, no ku onga kwa ongire nene. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Ine eyi mu na yapera nene? Epo no thsino thsikati ka mu di no thsitawo?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />A yapire nene no ku cipaura ci: “Oyu ne edye? O ku ninga ci shaanga mupepo no mañithsingi yaa mu yuvera!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa munu o mupepo oumango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesu nerongwa yenthzi a ka thsekerire mu thsambwadiya thzo Diviya dya Galilea, mu ditunga dya Geraseni. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Popa a shamukire Yesu mu wato, wa mu hanganyekire mukwerume o mupepo oumango oyu wa tundererire pa mararo. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Oyu munu shime ekarangire mu kaci ko idi pa mararo, karo kwithsa oyu wa twethsire ku mwanga, shaanga no madyenge. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Inene wangiwangire no madyenge no tungongoro, unone wa i cinunangire. Kwithsa munu oyu wekarire nokoro o ku mu oomeka. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Mutenya nothsiku shime a thzangire o endaura mu mararo no mu mikinya, o ku thza o kumbanga no ku cikuraura no mawe.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ou a monine Yesu o ku endera kokure, wa mu cirerire no ku ka tongama ku manwi ku rupara rwenthzi. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Ngou a karumukire ku amba ci: “Ine eyi o fota ku kwange Yesu, owe o Mwana Nyambi, aye o Kuthzinama Nene? Naa ku romba ko dithzina dya Nyambi, wa ni nyandithsa!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Shime a ambire kengeyo pakuninga ci Yesu wa ambire ci: “Owe o mupepo oumango, o tunde koyu munu!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Ngou honi Yesu a mwipurire ci: “Yowe odye dithzina dyoe?” Aye wa mu tawire ci: “Yame no Mungi, pakuninga ci twangi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Karo mupepo oumango wa adikanenine Yesu ci a u cithza ku u tundithsa muya mu ditunga.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Kwekarire mutanga oukuru o nguru ou wa dyererire ku mbadi thzo mukinya po pepi. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Mipepo thzothzimango thza adikanenine Yesu ci: “O tu tumithse kothziya nguru, o tu tawethze tu kengenemo.”<verse eid="MRK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesu wa thzi tawethzire. Ethzo mipepo thzothzimango ngou thza tundire koya munu no ku kengena ku nguru. Mutanga ouhe o nguru o ku fota kukwana 2,000 wa rundumukire ku urumuka pa muurumuko ku wera mu diviya no ku ka feramo ku meyu.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Awa thzi futithsire a cirire no ku ka tongora eyo enu eyo mu mbongi no mu maumbo. Anu ngou a thzire ku ka mona eyi ya tendaharire. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />A keyire kwa Yesu no ku na wana oya munu wekarire no mipepo thzothzimango thzothzingi o ku nekara o ku na vata, karo maano o ku a di nawa. Wahe a yapire. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Awa i monine a tongawerire waya a keyire eyi ya tendaharire koya mukwerume o mathzimu no thziya nguru. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ngou a adikanenine Yesu ci a tunde mu ditunga dyo.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Popa a shamukerire Yesu mu wato oya munu wekarire no mipepo thzothzimango wa adikanenine Yesu ci a thze nenthzi. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Unone ka a mu tawethzire, wa mu amberire ci: “Dyombo, o thze ku diumbo dyoe kwapoe, o ka wa tongawere yoihe eyi a na ku kwamena Fumu nedi a na ku fera ñeke.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Oyo mukwerume ngou a thzire mu Mambongi Dikumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike po Dekapolisi, ku amba ci “Mambongi o dikumi.”</char></note> o ku thza o tongaura okuru weyi a mu kwamenine Yesu, wahe a i cinjembukerire.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana Jairosi no mbuyama wekora yo diropa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Ou a hukire karo Yesu no wato mu thsambwadiya thzo diviya, mbunga thzothzikuru thza mu thsindakanine ku mu paka mu kaci kuya ku diya. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Kwa keyire muendithsi o sinagoge o dithzina dyo Jairosi. Ou a monine Yesu, wa tongamine ku mauru enthzi, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />no ku mu adikanena ci: “Mwanange o mbuyamaana aa kokangera, naa ku romba tu thze o ka mu kambeke moko a pore a yoye.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yesu wa thzire nenthzi. Mbunga thzothzikuru thza mu shupwerire no ku mu paka mu kaci kuninga ci mane thza mu thsindakanithsire. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Omo mu mbunga mwekarire mbuyama oyu wa korire ekora yo diropa myaka thzo dikumi na thzidi. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Wa nyandire nene kwakwakupanga owangi awa a mu manenine yoihe eyi ekarire nayo, unone ka mu kwathsire thsimweya, ekora mbeci i shumune ku kura. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Ou a yuvire ya Yesu, wa keyire munyima mu mbunga no ku na kwata ku thsikoveyo thsa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Wa tendire kengeyo pakuninga ci shime a anekerire ci: “Ou nga ni kwata pohuma shaanga ku thsikoveyo thsenthzi, kenge nga ni pora.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Ko wanguwangu diropa dyemanine, wa ciyuvire mwirama ci na poro kuya kwikora.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Kethsiya thsikati Yesu wa ciyuvire ci okoro wa tundire ku kwenthzi, popo wa cithsetukire no kwipura mbunga ci: “Edye na ni kwata ku thsikoveyo?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Erongwa ya mu tawire ci: “O mone, owe po anu aa ku thsindakana ne ngepi edi nga o wipura ci edye na ni kwata?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Unone Yesu wa endithsire anu ku meho ci a mone oyu na mu kwata. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Oya mbuyama pa ku dimuka eyi ya tendaharire ku kwenthzi, wa keyire o tutuma ko ku yapa no ku na wera ku mauru a Yesu no ku na mu tongawera shemwa yoihe eyi ya tendaharire ku kwenthzi. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Mwanange, thsitawo thsoe thsi na ku porithsa. O thze mu thsiyaro karo o pore kwikora yoe.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yesu o ku amba eyo, kwa kumine anu awa a tundire ku nthzio thza Jairosi muendithsi o sinagoge. A mu tongwerire ci: “Mwanoe o na nyanda, kwithsa eyi o cakanithsera murongithsi karo!”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Ou a i yuvire eyo Yesu ka i twarire mucima, wa amberire Jairosi ci: “Wa yapa, o tawe pohuma.”<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Wa kanithsire anu ku mu shupwera shime Peturu, Jakovo no minenthzi Johani. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Ou a ka kumine oko ku nthzio thzoyo muendithsi o sinagoge, wa ka wanine anu o kwa firika no ku dira makuano. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Wengenine no ku wepura ci: “Kwa ine kokuhe oku kufirika no makuano? Oyu mwanuke po ka a fire aa rara pohuma.”<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus raises Jairus' daughter" file="gt00050b.tif" size="col" loc="Mrk 5:36-43" copy="Gordon" ref="5.36-43">Yesu aa pindura kwafu mwana Jairosi</figure><verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Mbunga thza mu teururire, unone aye wa cithzire anu wahe ci a punene pora. Wa shimbire pohuma tata oya mwanuke no mama oya mwanuke, nerongwa iya ya keyire nenthzi, no kwingenano muya a pakire oya mwanuke. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Wa kwatire ku dyoko dyoya mwanuke no ku amba ci: “Talita kumi!” apopo kuninga ci: “Owe o mbuyamaana naa ku ninga ci o pinduke!” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Popo oya mbuyamaana wa katukire no ku tateka ku endaura. Nedi wa myaka thzo dikumi na thzidi. Popo anu a i cinjembukerire. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yesu wa wa kanithsire nene ci a i tongwera munu, karo wa wa amberire ci a mu pe edya.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">AkwaNazareta aa kana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu wa tundire omo no ku thza ku Nazareta ku mbongi thzo diumbo dyenthzi, erongwa yenthzi ya mu shupwerire. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Mu diyuwa dyo Savata wa tatekire ku rongithsa mu sinagoge. Ongi wanu awa a mu yuvire a komokire no ku amba ci: “Oyu munu ne kupi naa i wana eyi? Wa ngepi ou onyanyami naa piwa oyu? Ine eyi ekomokithsa yoikoro a kwama? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ene kadi yodiyo oya muyuwi oyu, mwana Madiya? Aminenthzi wodiyo awa a Jakovo na Josesi no Juda no Simoni? Andumbu thzenthzi ne kadi wodiyo awa tu na tunguno?” Eyi ya wa retithserire ci a mu anthzipere.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu ngou a wa amberire ci: “Mukwakukethza po aa remekiwa kokuhe, shime mu ditunga dyenthzi kwapenthzi nowa o mu mwanda ofoci nenthzi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Mukaci ko kukana ku tawa kwo, ka a twethsire ku kwama thsikomokithsa, shime akwakukora owapu a porithsire ko ku wa kambeka moko. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yesu wa komokire pa kupira kwo thsitawo.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu aa tuma erongwa yo dikumi na idi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu ngou a thzire o rongithsa anu mu diumbo no diumbo. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Wethsire erongwa yenthzi yo dikumi na idi, wa i tumine idi idi no ku i pa okoro o ku cithza mathzimu. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Wa i raererire ci ya shimba thsinu moro ruendo, ikare ñuta nji mikotana nji madi mwipaupau yo, shime muramu pohuma o ku endera. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Wa i amberire karo ci: “Mu vate mashangu, unone mwa shimba ekoveyo idi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Karo wa i amberire ci: “O ku mu na kumu mu mwanda, mu kekaremo, shime ou mwa ku tundamo omo mu mbongi. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Mu ndau omu a ku ka kana ku mi tambura nji ku mi teerera, mwa ku ka kukumune dikungu kwidyato yenu o ku mu tundamo, ci ikare ombangi ou wa ku wa wemeka.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Ngou a thzire no ku ka honga anu ci a cere evi yo. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />A cithzire mathzimu oangi no ku porithsa akwakukora owangi ko ku wa wethsa maathzi.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufa kwa Johani Mukwakukorovethza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Fumu Heroda wa yuvire ya Yesu, pakuninga ci dithzina dya Yesu shime dya yukire nene. Anu amweya shime ambire ci: “Johani Mukwakukorovethza na a pinduka kwafu, ngeyi ekarera nokoro o kukwama ekomokithsa yo kenge.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Awa amweya ci: “Mukwakukethza Eliya.” Awa karo ci: “Mukwakukethza o ku cipitura eci akwakukethza o kukare.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Unone Heroda ou a i yuvire wa ningire ci: “Johani oya na tetire mutwi, o na pinduriwa kwafu!”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Yodiyo mwene Heroda oyu wa tuminine ci Johani angiwe no ku pakiwa mu kamenga. Eyi shime a i kwamine ci a nyanyukithse Herodiasi, oyu a nyangire minenthzi Filipu. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Johani shime a amberangire Heroda ci: “Ko tawethziwire ku yeka munu wa minoe.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Herodiasi wa thzimbire Johani mane no ku fota ku mwipaa. Unone wa kwangire dyo ku tenda. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Mukaci ka Heroda ku yapa Johani pa ku mu dimuka ci munu o muwawa o mukenu, wa mu nyungire nawa. Heroda ou a yuvangire eyi a rongithsangire Johani, ya mu korithsangire ku mucima shaanga ci shime a fotangire ku teerera ku kwenthzi.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Ku hura Herodiasi wa wanine thsikati. Mu diyuwa dyo thsidika thso kwerekiwa kwa Heroda, ou a kwamine dishambirera oku ethserire manduna, akuru o mashwarare no mangumengume o mu Galilea. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Kwengenine mbuyamaana, mwana Herodiasi. Wa tatekire ku kina no ku nyanyukithsa Heroda nendenthzi. Ngou fumu Heroda a amberire oyo mbuyamaana ci: “O rombe thsothsihe ethsi o na foto kenge ni thsi ku pa.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Wa cethzerire ngoro ci: “Kenge ni ku pa thsothsihe ethsi o romba, shaanga kaci ko kutumina kwange kenge ni ku ku pa!”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Ngou a punine pora no ku kepura mama wenthzi ci: “Ine eyi ni ka romba?” Aye ngou a tawire ci: “Mutwi wa Johani Mukwakukorovethza!”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Popo oyo mbuyamaana wa yokororire ku huka kwa fumu no ku ka amba ci: “Naa fota ci o ni pe po pano mutwi wa Johani Mukwakukorovethza pa dironga!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Fumu wa i cinyengire nene, unone wa kwangire dyo ku i kana, pakuninga ci shime a tangire ku cethzera ngoro pa meho endenthzi awa ethserire ku thsidika. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Ngou a tumine wanguwangu dishwarare ku ka teta mutwi wa Johani no ku ka u mu retera. Dishwarare dya thzire no ku ka teta Johani mutwi mu kamenga. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Wa retire oo mutwi pa dironga no ku na u tambeka oyo mbuyamaana. Aye wa u twarire kwa mama wenthzi. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Erongwa ya Johani ou ya i yuvire, ya thzire ku ka shimba thsithzimbi no ku ka thsi vumbeka mu thsidi.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aekutithsa anu o 5,000</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Joh 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Tunganda twa hukire kwa Yesu no ku ka mu tongwera yoihe eyi twa ka kwamine, neyi twa ka rongithsire. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Mukaci kongi nene anu awa a ningire awa ku keya awa ku thza, Yesu nerongwa yenthzi a pirire no thsikati thso ku dya. Wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Tu thzenu kokumengi mu ka turumwithseko kamanana.”<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ngou a hunyunine ku thza kokumengi wafoci. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Unone anu owangi a wa monine o kwa thza karo a wa dimukire. Anu a tundire mu mambongi oahe no ku thza o cira mu kakuro no ku ka kuma ku diya awo o kwa shime ku ka thsekera. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Yesu ou a shamukire mu wato no ku mona mbunga thzothzikuru, wa wa yuverire ñekeñeke, inene shime cipiturire eci mangu o kupira mudithsani. Ngou a wa rongithsire enu yoingi.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Runguro diyuwa o ku di toka, erongwa ya keyire kwa Yesu no ku mu ambera ci: “Muno tu di po mu murundu no diyuwa dyaa toka. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />O ambere anu a cithzere mu maumbo no mu maumboana aa a di po pepi ci a ka ciurere edya.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Unone Yesu wa i tawire ci: “Mu wa pe edya yoyamwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Erongwa ya mu amberire ci: “Ene waa fota ci tu shimbe madi o kukwana 200 o muwayawaya tu ka wa urere edya na dye nji?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu wepurire ci: “Makende angashi mu di nao? Nga mu thze mu ka mone.” Ou a ka hukire a na mu tongwerire ci: “Makende mutanu no thsi thzidi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Yesu ngou a amberire erongwa ci i tongwere anu wahe ekare pashi pa mwenge kekwatakwata. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Ngou ekarire kekwatakwata, ekwata imweya ya kumine mu makumi o dikumi, imweya makumi o mutanu.<verse eid="MRK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Yesu wa shimbire ao makende o mutanu no thsi thzidi no ku diamena ku wiru, wa kandererire no ku i kuyaura. Ngou a i pire erongwa yenthzi ci i ere anu. Wa tendire kengeyo no ku thsi ku kwanithsa wahe. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Anu wahe a dire no kwikuta, <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />erongwa ya yarithsire mayongo o dikumi na edi omwamwaethzi o makende no thsi. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Ku tarako pohuma akwerume awa a dire aa kuma mu 5,000.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa enda pa meyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Joh 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Popo Yesu wa ooterire ci erongwa yenthzi i shamukere mu wato i citangethze mu thsambwadiya thzo diviya ku thza ku Betisaida, aye shime a thsiarire ku ambera anu ci a thze ku maumbo o. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Ou a manine ku vumenena anu, wa thzire pa mukinya ku ka rombera.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ou peraurire pashi, wato o ku ka endera pa kaci ko diviya, uno honi Yesu aye o ku di yofoci pa dikambo. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Yesu wa monine ci erongwa yenthzi yaa vua ko ku karupera, pakuninga ci shime ya tambire oku wa tundererire mupepo. Mu kaci ko thsikati thso muthsihatu nethsi thso mutanu na thsofoci thso mathsikuthsiku wa keyire kukwo o ku thza o enda pa meyu, wa ningire eci aa fota ku wa piterera, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />unone erongwa ou ya mu monine o ku enda pa meyu, ya anekerire ci ngwa thsirumba. Ya kumbire, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />inene yoihe ya mu monine karo ya yapire nene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Unone popo Yesu wa ambire nayo ci: “Mu tanare micima! Mwa yapa, yame.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Ngou a shamukerire mu wato, popo mupepo wa ongire. Erongwa ya cinjembukerire pohuma, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />shaanga uya a kwamine thsikomokithsa thso makende nothsi, erongwa ka ya i yuvithsithsire, inene micima thzayo thzikaru o ku kwata enu.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa akwakukora mu Genesareta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Ou a yavukire, a ka thsekerire mu ditunga dya Genesareta no ku kokera wato. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Popa a shamukire mu wato, popo anu a mu dimukire ci Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />A cirerire mu mandau oahe ku ka shimba akwakukora o kwa di pa tunaha two, no ku wa reta kokuhe oku a yuvire ci kodiyo a di Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Kokuhe oku a pitire Yesu mu mambongi no mu maumbo, anu a retangire pa mambanthza akwakukora. A rombangire Yesu ci a wa tawethze shaanga ku kwata ku minganja thzo thsikoveyo thsenthzi. Awa a kwatangireko wahe a porangire.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa yakwathsañuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat 15.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Afarithsi narongithsi amweya o murao awa a tundire mu Yerusalema a ciwanawanine ku thzingwera Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />A monine erongwa yenthzi imweya o ku i dya no moko o dithziro, ko kukana ku ciyoa ku moko. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Afarithsi no Majuda wahe a shupwerire thsithsemwa thsakuru, thso kukana ku dya edya o kwa shime ku ciyoa ku moko. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Shaanga o kwa na tundu ku maurithsero, kwithsa ku dya shime o kwa na ciyoo tango. Ko i di enu imweya yo thsithsemwa eyi a shupwerire, eci yo ku yoa manganja, tunyungu toma no mapoto o kopa.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Afarithsi narongithsi o murao ngou epurire Yesu ci: “Ine erongwa yoe eyi i kanena ku shupwera thsithsemwa thsakuru? Inene yaa dya no moko o dithziro?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Isaya wa shungire ou okethzire keyi yenu! Mwakwamahetaheta eci edi a ñorire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“ ‘Awa anu aa ni remeka ko miromo thzo pohuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">unone micima thzo kure thzi di nange.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Aa ni rombera yo tumbako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">inene aa rongithsa mirao thzanu eci thzaa tunda kwa Nyambi.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Mu na thsii thsiraerera thsa Nyambi no ku ñañerera mikarero thzo thsithsemwa thsenu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu wa wa amberire karo ci: “Mu di noñurungu o ku kana thsiraerera thsa Nyambi ci mu hengeke thsithsemwa thsenu! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Unone Mushe wa ambire ci: ‘O remeke tata woe no mama woe,’ karo ‘Munu yomuhe o ku shwahura tata wenthzi nji mama wenthzi aa roera ku fa.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Unone amwe mwaa tawethza munu ku ambera tata wenthzi no mama wenthzi ci: ‘Ethsi mu na roera ku wana ku kwange po Kobani’ (ku amba ci thso ku tupwera Nyambi). <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Oyo munu mu na mu tawethza honi ku kana ku kwathsa thsimweya tata wenthzi nji mama wenthzi. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Mweyo, mwaa kwangithsa Diywi dya Nyambi kwikara nokoro ko mikarero thzo thsithsemwa thsenu, ethsi mu thza o cirundwerera. Karo ko i di imweya yoingi eyi mu na tendanga yo ku pitura eci eyo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yo ku thsireka munu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15.10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yesu karo wethserire mbunga ku kwenthzi no ku wa ambera ci: “Mu ni teerere mwahe ci mu yuvithsithse eyi ni mi ambera. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Kadi cingwa ethsi thsi thza mu dira dyo munu ethsi nga thsi mu thsireka, unone thso ku tunda ku mucima wenthzi thsodiyo nga thsi twethsa ku mu thsireka.”<verse eid="MRK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />[Oyu di no matwi, a yuve!]<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Yesu wa thsiire mbunga no kwingena mu nthzio, erongwa yenthzi ya mwipurire yako kathsimo. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Ngou a i amberire ci: “Ene namwe kadi mwa kwa ku yuvithsithsa? Kwithsa thsinu thso ku dya munu thso ku twethsa ku mu thsireka. <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Inene edya ka i thzangire mu mucima, unone yaa thzanga mu dira no ku tundamo.” Pa ku amba kengeyo, Yesu wa monithsire ci edya yoihe ikenu pa meho a Nyambi.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Wa shumunine ku amba ci: “Thso ku tunda kwa munu thsodiyo thso ku twethsa ku mu thsireka. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Inene mu mucima o munu mo mwa tunda eanekera yoimango, yo ruthziho, withzi no kwipaa. <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />Ku rembeka, rununa, ñore, kwangera, ongurunde, mbamba, ruhopo, mununa notomba. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Yoihe eyo yoimango yaa tunda mu mucima o munu, yodiyo yo ku twethsa ku mu thsireka.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Thsitawo thso mbuyama o Munukenge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu ngou a tundire mu Galilea no ku thza ku ditunga dya Tire. Wa kengenine mu nthzio, inene ka a fotire ci anu a dimuke ci kwaa di. Unone wa kwangire ku cihoreka. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Mbuyama oyu wekarire no mwanenthzi o mbuyamaana, oyu wengenine mupepo oumango, ou a yuvire ya Yesu, wa keyire ku kwenthzi no ku na wera ku mauru enthzi. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Oyo mbuyama po nedi wa mushovo o Thsigerike <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nedi kadi Mujuda.</char></note>oyu erekerire mu mbongi thza Fenisia mu ditunga dya Siria. Wa rombire Yesu ci a tundithse mupepo oumango kwa mwanenthzi. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Mu thsie anuke a dye tango no kwikuta, inene ka i roerire ku shimba edya yanuke no ku i konthzera mbwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Aye wa tawire ci: “Fumu, eyo po ya shemwa. Unone shaanga mbwa ethzi thzi nekaranga mushi thzo tafure thzaa dyanga omwamwaethzi ou u na wanga kwanuke.” <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Mukaci ko ku tawa nawa kengeyo, o thze! Mupepo oumango u na tundu kwa mwanoe.” <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Wa hukire ku diumbo, no ku ka wana mwanenthzi o ku na rara podidi. Mupepo oumango o ku u na tundu ku kwenthzi.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa munu o kufa matwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yesu ou a tundire mu ditunga dya Tire wa cinakanine mu Sidoni ku thza ku Diviya dya Galilea no mu ditunga dya Dekapolisi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Ngou a mu reterire anu munu o kufa matwi no kukana ku twethsa ku amba nawa, no ku mu adikanena ci a mu kambeke moko a pore.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu wa mu twarire ku mbadi ku mukunda kokure nanu, wa pakire minwe mu matwi enthzi. Wa thsiperire mate ku minwe thzenthzi no ku mu kwata pa rudimi. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Yesu ngou a kengererire ku wiru no ku yoyomwethza. Wa ambire ci: “Efufata!” kuninga ci: “O vukuke!” <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Popo matwi oyo mukwerume a vukukire no rudimi rwenthzi rwa angurukire, wa twethsire ku amba nawa.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu ngou a wa koñomekire ku wa ambera ci katere a i tongwere munu. Unone shaanga ou a wa kanithsire ci a i tongwera munu, dyodi a wa kanithsire dya thzire o i tongora kokuhe oku a pitire. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Anu ou a i yuvire a komokire nene, ngou a ambire ci: “Na kwama enu yoihe nawa, mane aa yuvithsa nakwa kufa matwi, no ku ambithsa ashiamba.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aekutithsa anu o 4,000</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Mwao mayuwa mbunga thzothzikuru thza ciwanawanine. Kekarire nedya, Yesu wethsire erongwa yenthzi no ku i ambera ci: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Awa anu naa wa yuvera ñekeñeke, inene a na shimbi mayuwa ahatu o kwa di nange, unone ka di nedya honi. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Karo ci ni wa ninge ci a thze ku maumbo o no nthzara, kenge a pwererera pa kaci, inene amweya ku kwo aa tunda kokure.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Erongwa ya mu tawire ci: “Muno po mu murundu ne kupi nga a wana munu edya yo ku twethsa kwikutithsa anu awa kuma apa?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu wa ipurire ci: “Mu di no makende angashi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Ya mu tawire ci: “Tu di no makende mutanu na edi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Wa tuminine mbunga ci thzikare pashi. Ou a manine ku shimba ao makende o mutanu na edi no ku kanderera kwa Nyambi, wa a kuyaurire no ku pa erongwa ci i ere mbunga. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Karo ekarire no tuthsi totupu. Yesu wa tu fiyawerire no ku ambera erongwa yenthzi ci i tu ere mbunga.<verse eid="MRK 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Anu a dire no kwikuta. Munyima thzeyo, erongwa ya yarithsire mayongo o mutanu na edi omwamwaethzi. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Shime kwekarire akwerume o ku fota ku kuma mu 4,000. Ou a manine ku dya wa wa ningire ci a thze ku maumbo o. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Popo Yesu wa shamukerire mu wato nerongwa yenthzi no ku thza ku ditunga dya Dalumanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afarithsi aa romba thsimonithso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12.38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Afarithsi amweya a keyire kwa Yesu, a tatekire ku cikanyeka nenthzi. Ko ku mu ereka, a mu rombire ci a kwame thsimonithso thso ku monithsa ci okoro wenthzi waa tunda kwa Nyambi.<verse eid="MRK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu wa yoyomwethzire nene mu mupepo wenthzi no ku amba ci: “Ine eyi a rombera thsimonithso awa anu o rerodino? Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci kwithsa thsimonithso ethsi a piwa.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ou a manine ku amba eyi, wa yomamine mu wato no ku yavukera mu thsambwadiya thzo diviya.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mamene Afarithsi noa a Heroda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16.5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Erongwa ya vuramine ku paka edya mu wato. Shime ekarire pohuma no dikende dyofoci mu wato. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu wa wa koñomekire ku wa ambera ci: “Mu tunde ku mamene Afarithsi noa a Heroda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Erongwa ya tatekire ku i ciyongora mu kaciko no ku amba ci: “Aa amba eyi pa ku mona ci ka tu di nedya!” <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu wa dimukire eyi a ambire, ngou a wa amberire ci: “Ine eyi mu ambawera yo kupira edya? Epo no pano tu di mu shime ku dimuka no ku yuvithsithsa? Ethzi micima thzenu ne thzaa kwanga ngepi ku kwata enu? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Mu di no meho, mwaa kwanga ngepi ku mona? Karo mu di no matwi, mwaa kwanga ngepi ku yuva? Ine eyi mu kanena ku vuruka? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Uya na kuyawerire anu o 5,000 makende o mutanu ne, shime mwa yarithsire mayongo angashi omwamwaethzi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Ya mu tawire ci: “Mayongo o dikumi na edi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“No uya na kuyawerire anu o 4,000 makende o mutanu na edi ne, mayongo angashi mwa yarithsire omwamwaethzi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Ya tawire ci: “Mutanu na edi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Yesu ngou a ipurire ci: “No pano tu di ka mu yuvithsithsire?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa kapuputwa o mu Betisaida</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Ou a na kumine mu Betisaida, anu amweya a retire kapuputwa kwa Yesu, a mu adikanenine ci a mu kwate no ku mu porithsa. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu wa kwatererire oyo kapuputwa ku dyoko no ku mu tundithsa mu diumbo. Ngou a mu thsiperire mate pa meho no ku mu kambeka moko, wa mwipurire ci: “Ene wa twethsa ku mona thsinu?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Oyo mukwerume ou a kengire wa ambire ci: “Ii, naa mona anu, unone naa wa mona eci etondo eyi i endaura.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu ngou a mu pakire moko pa meho enthzi karo. Popo meho enthzi a kengire, wa porire no ku mona nawa enu yoihe. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu wa mu ningire ci a thze, no ku mu ambera ci: “O kondoroke diumbo dya Betisaida ku huka ku diumbo dyoe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peturu aa amba ci Yesu po Mesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu nerongwa yenthzi a tundire mu Galilea no ku thza mu maumbo aa a na cihata no mbongi thza Sesarea Filipi. Mu dikuñwa wa ipurire ci: “Anu ne a ninga ci yame nodye?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Ya mu tawire ci: “Amweya aa ninga ci yowe o Johani Mukwakukorovethza, amweya ci yowe o Eliya, amweya ci o yumweya wakwakukethza.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Ngou a ipurire ci: “Amwe ne mwaa ninga ci yame nodye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Peturu wa mu tawire ci: “Yowe o Mesiya.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yesu wa i koñomekire ku i ambera ci katere ya ku i tongwere munu ci yodiyo Mesiya.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu a okethza yo kufa kwenthzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16.21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Yesu ngou a tatekire ku wa tongwera ci Mwana Munu kenge a ku nyandithsiwa nene no ku kaniwa kwaendithsi, akuru o mapurisita narongithsi o murao. Karo kenge a kwipaiwa no kupinduka kwafu munyima thzo mayuwa ahatu. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Shime a ambire eyi thsitonwameho. Peturu ngou a mu twarire ko kumengi no ku ka i mu kuturura.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Yesu wa pirukire no ku kenga erongwa yenthzi, no ku kuturura Peturu ci: “O tunde ku kwange owe Satana, eanekera yoe po yanu kadi ci ngwa ya Nyambi!”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Yesu wethsire mbunga nerongwa yenthzi, no ku wa ambera ci: “Munu o ku fota ku ni shupwera, a shuve mwoyo wenthzi, a shimbe mbinda thzenthzi a ni shupwere. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Karo munu yomuhe o ku nyunga nene mwoyo wenthzi, kenge a ku u yawa. Unone yomuhe o ku yawa mwoyo wenthzi mukaci kange no Muthzimbu Ouwa, kenge a ku u wana. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Owa wine o ku fuma kaye kokahe, unone waa yawa mwoyo o diyere? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Thsinu mwine ethsi nga a punithsa munu ci a ure mwoyo wenthzi karo? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Mweyo, munu o ku ni fera honyi ame no maywi ange, mo ano mayuwa o mukuta o kukana ku rurama no thsivi, Mwana Munu naye kenge a ku mu fera honyi ou a ku ka huka mu kutethzima kwa Tata no tungeru totukenu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Wa shumunine ku amba ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci amweya awa a di pano ka ku fa o kwa shime ku mona Kutumina kwa Nyambi o ku ku keya kokoro.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa piruka no ku monahara kutethzima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Munyima thzo mayuwa o mutanu na dyofoci Yesu wa shimbire Peturu, Jakovo no Johani no ku wa twara pa mukinya oure apa a kekarire wafoci. Apo paa ka pirukerire o kwa na mu tanekera. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Evata yenthzi ya tethzima nene, okenu o kuninga ci kwithsa o ku twethsa ku u kwama mu kaye. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Kwa monaharire Eliya na Mushe awa a ambaurire na Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Peturu ngou a amberire Yesu ci: “Murongithsi, i na roo eyi tu di kuno, tu kwame matunu ahatu, dimweya dyoe, dimweya dya Mushe nedi dya Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Aye na enthzenthzi shime a yapire nene, ka a dimukire neyi a ambire.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Kwa keyire divui edi dya wa thsikire, karo diywi dya tundire mu divui edi dya ambire ci: “Oyu po Mwanange oyu na shima, mu mu yuve!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Erongwa ou ya kengire nokunoku kwithsa oyu ya monine shime Yesu pohuma oyu wekarireno.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />O kwa urumuka ku tunda pa mukinya, Yesu wa i raererire ci ya ka tongwera munu eyi i na ka mona, shime Mwana Munu ou a kupinduka kwafu. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ya hengekire aa maywi mu micima thzayo, unone ya cipaurire mu kaci kayo ci: “Eyi yo kupinduka kwafu ne yo ine?”<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Ngou yepurire Yesu ci: “Ine eyi a na amberanga arongithsi o murao ci Eliya yo na roera kutanga ku keya?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu wa i tawire ci: “Yoshemwa Eliya o na roera kutanga ku keya no ku na huthsera enu yoihe. Unone ine honi eyi ku na ñoriwera ci Mwana Munu aa roera ku nyanda nene no ku kaniwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Uno honi naa mi tongwera ci Eliya naa keya, na na mu kwama yoihe eyi na foto eci edi ya ñoriwire keyi yenthzi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa mukwerumeana o mupepo oumango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-20">Mat 17.14-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luk 9.37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ou a kokerire kwirongwa imweya, a monine anu owangi awa i pakire mu kaci narongithsi o murao awa a cikanyekireno. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Mbunga thzothzihe popa thza monine Yesu thza komokire nene no kungumukera ku kwenthzi ku ka mu vumenena.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu wepurire arongithsi o murao ci: “Ine eyi mu cikanyekano?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Mukwerume mu mbunga wa tawire ci: “Murongithsi, shime ni na reta mwanange o mukwerumeana ku koe oyu na wingena mupepo oumango ou u na mu kwangithsa ku amba. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Ou mupepo popahe apa u na mu kwateranga waa mu huwera pashi kokoro. Karo waa mu tupurithsanga kafuthzi ku miromo no ku citafuna ku maeo no ku ara. Ni na rombo erongwa yoe ci i u cithze ou mupepo, unone ka i twethsire.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Amwe mwanu o kupira thsitawo! Thsikati thso ku kuma kupi na kwikara nenu? Thsikati thso ku kuma kupi na ku mi kunda amwe? O u ni retere oyo mukwerumeana.”<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />A mu retire kwa Yesu. Mupepo oumango popa wa monine Yesu, wa huwerire oya mwanuke pashi no ku hanyahanya no ku tupura kafuthzi ku kanwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu wepurire tata oya mwanuke ci: “Thsikati thso ku kuma kupi na i mu shimbi oyu mwanuke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Wa tawire ci: “Ku tunda ku wanuke wenthzi. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Rorungi o ku u fota ku mwipaa pa ku mu huweranga mu mudiro no mu meyu. O tu yuvere ñekeñeke, o tu kwathse, ngeci waa twethsa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Waa ninga ci ngeci waa twethsa? Enu yoihe yaa tawa kwa munu kamona ayepo tawa pohuma.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Ko wanguwangu oya tata oya mwanuke, ou a i yuvire, wa karumukire ku amba ci: “Ni na tawa, o ni kwathse mu kupira kwange thsitawo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu ou a monine ci mbunga thzaa keya o cirera ku kwenthzi, wa kutururire oo mupepo oumango ci: “Owe o mupepo o shiamba no kufa matwi, naa ku tumina o tunde koyu mwanuke karo katere wa ku ka huke ku kwenthzi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Mupepo oumango ngou wa kumbire no ku huwera oya mukwerumeana pashi no ku hanyahanya nene, mbeci u tunde ku kwenthzi, ku mu thsia eci thsithzimbi ku ninga ci mane anu owangi a ambire ci: “O na fu!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Unone Yesu wa mu kwatire ku dyoko ku mu katukithsa, ayepo o wimana.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Yesu ou ekarire nerongwa yenthzi mu nthzio wafoci, ya mwipurire ci: “Ine eyi tu na kwangera atwe ku u tundithsa ou mupepo oumango?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Wa wa tawire ci: “Mupepo oumango o mushovo ou tumba u twethsa ku tundithsiwa ko thsinu thsathso shime ko thsirombero.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu a okethza yo kufa kwenthzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luk 9.43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />A tundire muya mu ndau, a cinakanine ditunga dya Galilea pa kaci. Yesu ka a fotire ci anu a dimuke oku ekarire. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Inene shime aa fotire kwikara nerongwa yenthzi o ku i rongithsa. Wa i amberire ci: “Mwana Munu kenge a ku piwa mu moko anu, awo kenge a ku mwipaa. Ou a ku pwa ku paiwa, kenge a ku pinduka kwafu munyima thzo mayuwa ahatu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Unone ka ya yuvithsithsire eyi a ambire, karo ya yapire ku i mwipura.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O mukuru ne edye?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />A kumine mu Kapenauma. Ou engenine mu nthzio, Yesu wepurire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Ine iya mu na cikanyeka mu dikuñwa?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ka ya mu tawire thsimweya, inene eyi ya cikanyekire po yo kuninga ci o mukuru ku kwo ne edye? <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu wekarire no kwithsa tunganda to dikumi na twidi no ku tu ambera ci: “Yomuhe o ku fota ci ekare o kutanga aa roera kwikara ku hura no kwikara ngamba wanu wahe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Wa shimbire kanuke no ku kemeka mu kaciko. Wa ka yerurire no ku ka paka pa moko enthzi no ku wa ambera ci: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Munu yomuhe o ku tambura kanuke eci aka mu dithzina dyange, yame a na tambura. O ku ni tambura ka a tamburire ame pohuma, unone aa tambura aye oyu naa ni tumu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O kukana ku tu rwithsa aa twimanena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9.49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Johani wa amberire Yesu ci: “Murongithsi, tu na mono munu oyu na cithzi mathzimu ko dithzina dyoe, tu na mu kanithsa, inene kadi wa thsipani thsetu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Unone Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Nga ka mu mu kanithsire. Kwithsa munu o ku kwama ekomokithsa ko dithzina dyange o ku twethsa ku ni piruka ku amba yoimango ku kwange, <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />o kukana ku tu rwithsa, aa twimanena. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Munu yomuhe o ku mi pa shaanga nganja thzo meyu mukaci ko kuninga ci mwakwa Krisitu, naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci kenge a ku wana muyambo wenthzi.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enu yo ku twara ku thsivi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18.6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Karo ngeci kwaa di oyu wa ku huwapo munu kowa owaonye awa na tawa ku kwange, i di nawa ci nga a angereriwa diwe dyodikuru mu thsingo no ku konthzeriwa mu diwate. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Ngeci dyoko dyoe dyaa ku twara ku thsivi, o di teteko. Ku di nawa ku koe kwingena mu mwoyo no dyoko dyofoci kupita ku thza no moko edi mu dihere mu mudiro o kukana ku thzimana, <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />[mu mavinyo a shifu no mu mudiro u shithzimana.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Ngeci diuru dyoe dyaa ku twara ku thsivi, o di teteko. Ku di nawa kwingena mu mwoyo o ku di thsirema kupita ku konthzeriwa mu dihere no mauru edi, <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />[mu mavinyo a shifu no mu mudiro u shithzimana]. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Ngeci po dithziho dyoe dyaa ku twara ku thsivi, o di thzongoremo. Ku di nawa ku thza mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi no dithziho dyofoci kupita ku konthzeriwa no meho edi mu dihere, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />mu mavinyo a shifu no mu mudiro u shithzimana.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Inene munu no munu kenge a ku toviwa no mungwa o mudiro. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Mungwa po uwa, unone ngeci u na tutukwa ne ngepi nga u towarithsiwa karo? Mwikare mwa mungwa, mwikare ko thsiyaro naenthzenu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa rongithsa yo kufa ko maruo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu ou a tundire mu Kapenauma, wa thzire mu ditunga dya Judea no mu thsambwadiya thzo Rware rwa Jorodani. Mbunga karo thza nongumanine ku kwenthzi, eci edi a tendangire wa tatekire ku wa rongithsa.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Afarithsi amweya a keyire ku kwenthzi ku na mu ereka ku mu ta pa rudimi ko ku na mwipura ci: “Ene mukwerume ne aa tawethziwa ci a kane munu wenthzi nji?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu wa wa tawire ko ngudi ci: “Mushe ne ngepi a mi raererire?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Awo ngou a mu tawire ci: “Mushe shime a tawethzire ci mukwerume a ñorere diñoro munu wenthzi dyo ku mu rukurura no ku mu kondora.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Unone Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Mukaci kokaru o micima thzenu yodiyo a mi pererire Mushe ethsi thsiraerera. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Ku tunda ku matatekero Nyambi ou ombire enu yoihe, wombire mukwerume no mbuyama. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Mukaci keyo, mukwerume kenge mba a thsia tata wenthzi no mama wenthzi no ku cikwata na munuwenthzi. <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Awo aidi kenge mba piruka thsirama thsofoci. Mweyo kadi aidi karo, unone thsirama thsofoci. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Mweyo, ethsi naa waneka Nyambi, munu katere a thsi tepe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Yesu o ku di mu nthzio, erongwa yenthzi ya i mwipurire karo eyo. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Wa i amberire ci: “Mukwerume yomuhe o ku rukurura munuwenthzi no ku yeka wao o na rembeka. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />No mbuyama o ku kana munuwenthzi no ku yekiwa kwa mukwerume wao o na rembeka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa fiyawera anuke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Anu a retire twanuke kwa Yesu ci na a tu kambeke moko no ku tu fiyawera, unone erongwa ya wa kutururire.<verse eid="MRK 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Ou a i monine eyo Yesu, wa anthzipire no ku ambera erongwa yenthzi ci: “Mu thsie twanuke tu keye ku kwange, mwa tu kanithsa, inene Kutumina kwa Nyambi po kwanu o kwikara eci ato. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci munu o kukana ku tambura Kutumina kwa Nyambi eci mwanuke, mbera kaengenamo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Ngou a pakire oto twanuke pa moko enthzi, wa tu kambekire moko no ku tu fiyawera.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mushumba o fumanyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu ou a katukire ci a thze, kwa keyire ku kwenthzi mukwerume oyu wa keyire o cira. Wana tongamine ku rupara rwa Yesu no ku mwipura ci: “Murongithsi o muwawa, ine eyi ni na roera ku tenda ci ni wane mwoyo o diyere?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Ine eyi o ni thsera ci o muwawa? Kwithsa o muwawa shime Nyambi yofoci! <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />O na dimuka eraerera yo kuninga ci: ‘Kadi o mukwa kwipaa, kadi o mukwa ku rembeka, kadi o mukwa kwithza, kadi o mukwa ku pa ombangi o tumbako, kadi o mukwa ku kupakupa muenthzoe, o remeke tata oe no mama oe.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Oyo mukwerume wa tawire ci: “Murongithsi, na i hengeka yoihe eyo ku tunda ku wanuke wange!”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu wa mu kengererire ko thsishimo, no ku mu ambera ci: “Ku na ku thsiarera thsinu thsofoci pohuma. O thze, o ka urithse eyi o di nayo yoihe, ao madi o ka a pe ahepwe ci wa kwikare no rufumo mu wiru. Ku tunda apo, o keye no ni shupwere.”<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Oyo mukwerume wa enine ou a yuvire eyo, wa thzire o cishoshomwa, pakuninga ci shime a fumine nene.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu wa endithsire meho no ku ambera erongwa yenthzi ci: “Ikaru nene afumanyi kwingena mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi!” <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Erongwa yenthzi ya komokire ao maywi, unone Yesu wa shumunine ku amba ci: “Anange, ikaru nene kwingena mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Mane ioto ci kamere engene mu dithziho dyo thsonga, kupita ci fumanyi engene mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Erongwa ya komokire kupita pa kutanga, no ku cipura ci: “Edye ne nga yoyithsiwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu wa i kengererire no ku amba ci: “Kwanu po tumba i tawa, unone kwa Nyambi po yaa tawa, inene kwa Nyambi po enu yoihe yaa tawa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Peturu ngou a mu amberire ci: “O na mono, atwe po na tu thsii enu yoihe no ku ku shupwera!”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci kwithsa munu oyu na a thsii nthzio thzenthzi, nji akurwenthzi nji aminenthzi, nji andumbuthzenthzi, nji tata wenthzi no mama wenthzi, nji anenthzi nji makanda enthzi mukaci kange no mukaci ko Muthzimbu Ouwa, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />oyu wa kukana ku tambura makumi o dikumi mo thsino thsikati pa thsinu no thsinu ethsi na a thsii, ikare manthzio, nji akurwenthzi nji aminenthzi, andumbuthzenthzi, mama wenthzi, tata wenthzi, anenthzi no makanda enthzi pofoci kengeyo no makando, karo a ku wane mwoyo o diyere mu kaye aka ka keya. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Unone owangi awa di ku rupara thsino thsikati kenge a kwikara kunyima, karo awa a di kunyima thsino thsikati kenge a kwikara ku rupara.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tongora ro muthsihatu yo kufa no kupinduka kwenthzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />O kwa thza mu dikuñwa ku kambama ku thza ku Yerusalema, Yesu shime a endire ku rupara, erongwa yenthzi ya komokire. Karo nanu awa mu shupwerire a yapire. Yesu wethserire erongwa yenthzi yo dikumi na idi ku mbadi no ku i tongawera eyi ya ku mu keyera. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Wa i amberire ci: “Mu teerere, twaa kambama ku thza ku Yerusalema, oku a ku ka piwa Mwana Munu mu moko akuru o mapurisita narongithsi o murao. A ku ka mu ratwere kufa no ku mu pa mu moko Anukenge. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Awo kenge a ku ka mu teurura, kenge a ku ka mu thsipera mate, a ku ka mu fure no ku mwipaa, unone munyima thzo mayuwa ahatu kenge a ku pinduka kwafu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsiromba thsa Jakovo na Johani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20.20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Ngou Jakovo na Johani ana Zebedea, a keyire kwa Yesu no ku mu ambera ci: “Murongithsi, ko i di eyi tu romba ci nga o i tu kwamene.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu wa wepurire ci: “Ine eyi mu na foto ci ni mi kwamene?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Awo a mu tawire ci: “Ou wa ku keya mu kutethzima koe, wa ku tu tawethze twa kwikare oyu ku rudyo rwoe, oyu ku rumoho rwoe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Unone Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Ka mu dimukire eyi mu romba. Ene kenge nga mu twethsa ku nwa omu mu nganja thzo makando na ku nwa, nji ku korovethziwa ko korovethzo thzo makando ethzi na ku korovethziwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Awo a mu tawire ci: “Twaa twethsa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Yesu wa ambire ku kwo ci: “Ii, yoshemwa, kenge mwa ku nwa mu nganja omu na ku nwa, karo kenge mwa ku korovethziwa ko korovethzo ethzi na ku korovethziwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Unone eyo yo kwikara ku rudyo nji ku rumoho rwange po ka ni di nokoro o ku i pa. Nyambi pohuma yodiyo o di nokoro o ku i pa awa naa i roithsera.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Erongwa imweya yo dikumi ou ya yuvire eyi a rombire a Jakovo na Johani ya wa anthziperire. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yesu ngou a ithserire pofoci yoihe no ku i ambera ci: “Mu na dimuka ci awa a na shimbiwa ci aendithsi wAnukenge aa dyaterera anu awa a na endithsa, karo awa a di neturo yoikuru aa monithsa okoro wo ku mbunga. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Uno honi ku kwenu ka ku di kengeyo. Oyu na foto kwikara o mukuru a pwe ngamba wenu. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Oyu na foto kwikara o kutanga ku kwenu ekare mupikenu mwahe. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Inene shaanga Mwana Munu ka na a keyera ci naa kwameniwe, unone aa keyera ku na kwamena anu amweya no ku na pa mwoyo wenthzi kwikara thsipaturithso thsa anu owangi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa kapuputwa o dithzina dyo Batimea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />A na kumine mu Jeriko, Yesu nerongwa yenthzi, no mbunga thzothzikuru o kwa tunda mu mbongi, mukwerume o kapuputwa o dithzina dyo Batimea, mwana Timea, shime ekarire ku mbadi thzo mukwakwa ku romba ekwathsa. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ou a yuvire ci Yesu wa Nazareta oyu pita, wa tatekire ku kumba ci: “Yesu, Mwana Davida! Ni fere ñeke!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Anu owangi a mu kutururire no ku mu ambera ci a tutware.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:48">Unone aye mbeci a kumbe nene ci: “Mwana Davida, o ni fere ñeke!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu ou a mu yuvire, wemanine no ku amba ci: “Mu mu tongwere a keye kuno.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Ngou a tongwerire oya kapuputwa ci: “O tanare mucima, o katuke! Aa kwithsa!” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Wa konthzire thsikoveyo thsenthzi no ku vayumuka ku thza kwa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu wa mwipurire ci: “Waa fota ci ni ku kwamene ine?” Oyo kapuputwa wa mu tawire ci: “Ñathsire wange, naa fota ku mona!”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O thze! Thsitawo thsoe thsi na ku porithsa!” Popo wa monine, no ku shupwera Yesu mu mukwakwa.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aengena mu Yerusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Joh 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />O kwa kokera ku Yerusalema, po pepi no maumbo a Betifage na Betania pa Mukinya wEtondo yo Miywera, Yesu wa tumine idi kwirongwa yenthzi ku citangethza. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Wa i amberire ci: “Mu thze muya mu diumbo di di pa rupara, popa mu kengenamo, kenge mu ka wana thsindongiana ethsi thsi na fungiwa, ethsi a kana ku pahama munu. Mu ka thsi puture no ku thsi reta kuno. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Yomuhe oyu ka mipura ci: ‘Ine eyi mu tendera kengeyo?’ Mu ka mu ambere ci: ‘Fumu na thsi foto karo aa ka thsi huthsa popano.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Ya thzire no ku ka wana thsindongiana ethsi thsa fungereriwire pora pa thsero thzo nthzio, ku mbadi thzo dikuñwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Anu amweya awa emanine apo, a ipurire ci: “Ine eyi mu kwama, mwaa thsi putwera ine ethso thsindongiana?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Erongwa ya tawire eci edi a i amberire Yesu, a i tawethzire ci i thze nathso. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />A retire thsindongiana kwa Yesu, no ku yarapo ekoveyo yo, Yesu ngou a pahaminepo.<verse eid="MRK 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Anu owangi a yarire ekoveyo yo mu mukwakwa, amweya a yarire mapukumuna aa a ka tetire mu makanda. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Awa a tangerire ku rupara nowa thsiarerire munyima a kuererire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hosana!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku amba ci “Ku shangariwe.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 11:9">Wa thsiyauthzi oyu keya mu dithzina dya Fumu!<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />“Kwa thsiyauthzi Kutumina kwa tata wetu Davida oku ku keya! Hosana mu diwiru!” <verse eid="MRK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu wengenine mu Yerusalema no ku thza ku Tembere. Ou a manine ku rondorora enu yoihe, wa tundiremo pakuninga ci nedi kanguronguro. Ngou a thzire nerongwa yenthzi yo dikumi na idi ku Betania.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa kuta thsitondo thsokuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko o kwa tunda mu Betania, Yesu wa yuvire nthzara. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Wa monine thsitondo thsokuyu ko kure kamanana, ethsi thsekarire no mamuna oangi. Ngou a thzireko ku ka mona ci kenge nga a wanako ñuyu. Unone ou a ka kumineko ka a ka wanineko thsimweya shime mamuna pohuma, inene nedi kadi thsikati thso kwima. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Yesu ngou a amberire ethso thsitondo thsokuyu ci: “Mbera kwa dya munu ñuyu ku koe karo!” Erongwa yenthzi ya yuvire ao maywi.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa kanithsa ku urithsera mu Tembere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Joh 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Ou a kumine mu Yerusalema, Yesu wengenine mu Tembere no ku tateka ku cithzacithzamo awa a urithsire nowa a urire. Wa thzire o thsindathzekera pashi matafure owa cinjire madi, nepura yowa a urithsire mayembe. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Ka a tawethzire munu ku pitithsa muuro mu dirapa dyo Tembere. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />O ku wa rongithsa, wa wa amberire ci: “Ene ka ya ñoriwa ci: ‘Nthzio thzange kenge mba thzithsiwa nthzio thzerombero thzo mambunga oahe’? Unone amwe mwaa thzi pirura macihoreko ethzi.”<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus clears out the Temple" file="lb00316b.tif" size="col" loc="Mrk 11:15-18" copy="Knowles" ref="11.15-18">Yesu aa cithzacithza awa a urithserire mu Tembere</figure><verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Akuru o mapurisita narongithsi o murao ou a i yuvire eyo, a tatekire ku ceka dyo ku mwipaa. Inene shime a mu yapire mukaci kerongithsa yenthzi eyi ya komokithsire mbunga thzothzihe.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Runguro Yesu nerongwa yenthzi a tundire mu thsikuña.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa yo thsitondo thsokuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21.20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Mathsikuthsiku diyuwa edi dya randireko o kwa pita kengeyo mu dikuñwa, a monine thsiya thsitondo thsokuyu ci thsi na kukuta ku tatekera ku mithzithzi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Peturu ngou a vurukire eyi ya tendaharire, wa amberire Yesu ci: “Ñathsire wange, o mone uya okuyu no kutu u na kukuta!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu wa i tawire ci: “Mwikare no thsitawo kwa Nyambi! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci yomuhe o ku ambera ou mukinya ci: ‘O thzuruke o ka cikonthzere mu diwate,’ karo kadi wa ku tamangera mu mucima wenthzi, unone aa tawa ci eyi a na amba kenge i tendahara, kenge a ku i tendiwera. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Mweyo, naa mi ambera ci yoihe enu eyi mu romba ko thsirombero mu kurupere ci mu na i piwa, karo kenge ya kwikara yenu. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Yoihe mwimana ku rombera, mu tange tango ku tetera yomuhe oyu naa mipithsera ci Tata wenu o mu wiru a mi tetere namwe mirandu thzenu. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />[Unone ngeci kadi mwakwa ku tetera awa a na mipithsera, Tata wenu o mu wiru naye ka a ku mi tetera mirandu thzenu.]”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka thzi di mu mañoro o kutanga.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aepuriwa pokoro wenthzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />A kumine mu Yerusalema karo, Yesu o ku endaura mu dirapa dyo Tembere, akuru o mapurisita narongithsi o murao nakuru o mbunga a keyire ku kwenthzi. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />A mwipurire ci: “Kokoro upi ou tenda eyi enu eyi? Karo edye naa ku pa okoro o ku i tenda.”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Ni mipure ngudi thzofoci, ngeci o mu ni tawe, name kenge ni mi tongwera ou okoro ni kwamithsa eyi. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Okoro wa Johani o ku korovethza ne waa tunda ku wiru nji kwanu? Mu ni tongwere.”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />A i ciyongorire mu kaciko, no ku amba ci: “Ngeci o tu ambe ci: ‘Waa tunderera ku wiru,’ aye kenge a twipura ci: ‘Ine eyi na mu kana ku tawa yenthzi?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Unone ngeci o tu ninge ci: ‘Waa tunderera kwanu?’ ” Apo honi shime a yapire anu, inene wahe a tawire ci Johani nedi mukwakukethza shemwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Ngou a tawire ci: “Ka tu dimuka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Yesu wa ambire ci: “Name ka ni mi tongwera oukoro ni kwamithsa eyi ci waa tunda kupi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo kanjimi owamango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yesu wa tatekire ku wa rongithsa ko tuthsimo, wa ambire ci: “Munu yumweya wa kunine dikanda dyo veine. Wa di thzingurukithsire thsipaka, wa thsiminemo diteke dyo thsikameno thso waine no ku yaramo otara o kwingera. Wa di thsiire mu moko anjimi ci a di nyunge, aye no ku thza ruendo. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Mu thsikati thso ku koyora veine, wa ka tumineko mupikenthzi ko waya anjimi ci a ka mu shimbereko veine ku veine o muya mu dikanda. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Unone awaya anjimi a kwatire oya mupika ku mu fura no ku mu huthsa mokomoko. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Thsinda thsa dikanda ngou a ka tumineko mupika yumweya. Oyo a ka mu furire ku mutwi no ku mu tenda dyodimango. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Karo wa tumine yumweya. Oyo aye a ka mwipaire. Wa tumineko owangi amweya, amweya a ka wa furire, awa kwipaa. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Thsinda thsa dikanda wa thsiarire pohuma no munu yofoci o ku tuma, mwanenthzi oyu a shima nene. Ku hura wa mu tumineko, wa ambire ci: ‘Kenge a ka mu remeka pakuninga ci mwanange.’<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />“Unone awo anjimi a ciambathsanine ci: ‘Shwana wenthzi o na kumu, mwiye tu mwipae twa ku shwane dikanda!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Ngou a mu kwatire no ku mwipaa ku mu konthzera pora thzo dikanda dyo veine.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Yesu wepurire ci: “Oya thsinda thsa dikanda ne ine a ku tenda ko waya anjimi? Kenge a ku keya ku na wepaa no ku na pa dikanda kwanjimi amweya. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Ene ka mwa tara mu Mañoro diywi dyo ku amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“ ‘Diwe edi na kende akwakuumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">di na piruka diunthzi dyo nthzio.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Fumu na a kwama eyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">karo yaa komokithsa atwe tu i mona.’?”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Aendithsi o Majuda a fotire ku kwata Yesu pa ku nangura ci ako kathsimo po ka shembo thzo ku thsangera ku kwo, unone a yapire mbunga. Ngou a mu thsiire no ku cithzera.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngudi thzo ku tera mutero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Yesu a mu tumithserire Afarithsi amweya nakwathsipani thsa Heroda ku na mu ta pa rudimi ko ngudi ci a mu kwaterepo. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />A keyire no ku na mu ambera ci: “Murongithsi, tu na dimuka ci waa ambanga yoshemwa ko wa hangwera munu, karo ko wa wana mavwevwe. Waa rongithsanga dikuñwa dyo shemwa dya Nyambi. Pano o tu tongwere, ene yaa tawethziwa ci atwe tu tere mutero kwa Sesare nji dyombo? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Tu tere nji twa tera?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:15">Yesu wa dimukire mahetaheta o, ngou a wa amberire ci: “Mwaa ni tera ine pa rudimi? Mu ni retere madi o muwayawaya ni a mone!” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />A a mu reterire, Yesu ngou a wepurire ci: “Ethsi thsikupuro nedi dithzina i dipo ne yadye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">A mu tawire ci: “Ya Sesare!”<figure style="fig" alt="Denarius coin" file="hk00166b.tif" size="col" loc="Mrk 12:13-17" copy="Knowles" ref="12.13-17">Muwayawaya o madinari</figure><verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Mu pe Sesare ya Sesare, no Nyambi mu mu pe ya Nyambi!” Eyi a tawire ya wa komokithsire.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yo kupinduka kwafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Kwa keyire Asaduki amweya kwa Yesu, anu awa kana ku tawa ci ko ku di kupinduka kwafu. A na mwipurire ngudi ci: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Murongithsi, Mushe wa tu pire murao ci ngeci mukwerume ayepo fa ku thsia difakathzi dyo kupira mwana, mukurwe nji minenthzi aa roera ku yeka oya difakathzi ci erekere mukurwe nji minenthzi ana. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Kwekarire ana munu yofoci o mutanu naidi. Mukurwo wa yekire mbuyama no kufa ko kukana ku wana nenthzi mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Oyu wa mu randire wa yekire oya difakathzi, naye karo wa fire ko kukana ku wana nenthzi mwana. Yekarire kengeyo noku koyu o muthsihatu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Wahe akwa mutanu naidi a mu yekire ko kupira oyu wa wanine nenthzi mwana. Ku hura naye mbuyama wa fire. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Mu diyuwa dyo kupinduka kwafu ne, oya mbuyama ne kenge a kwikara munu wadye, inene wahe akwa mutanu naidi a mu yekire?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Mu na yongo, inene ka mu dimukire eyi ya ñoriwire mu Mañoro nji okoro wa Nyambi. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Inene afu ou mba pinduka, akwerume mbera ka yeke nji ambuyama ku thza ku maruo, unone kenge mbekara eci tungeru to mu wiru.<verse eid="MRK 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />“Keyi yo kupinduka kwafu ne ka mwa tara mu vuka thza Mushe yo thsipukumuna thso ku yuuma, Nyambi ou a amberire Mushe ci: ‘Yame no Nyambi wa Aburahama, Nyambi wa Isaka no Nyambi wa Jakovo’? <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Aye po kadi cingwa Nyambi wafu, unone wayumi. Apopo mu na yongo nene!”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsiraerera thsoshokuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Murongithsi yumweya o murao wa keyire no ku wa yuva o kwa cikanyeka. Karo wa monine ci Yesu wa wa tawire nawa. Wa mwipurire ci: “Thsipi thsiraerera thsothsikuru nene mu thsivaka kupita yoihe?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Thsiraerera thsothsikuru po ethsi, ‘O teerere, owe Isiraele, Fumu Nyambi wetu, Fumu po yofoci. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Mweyo, waa roera ku shima Fumu Nyambi woe ko mucima woe ouhe no mwoyo woe ouhe no maano oe oahe nokoro woe ouhe.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Thsiraerera thso muthsidi po ethsi, ‘O shime muenthzoe eci edi wa cishima othsinda.’ Kwithsa thsiraerera thso kupita eyi kukuru.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Oya murongithsi o murao wa tawire ci: “O na amba nawa Murongithsi! O na amba yoshemwa pa ku amba ci Nyambi po yofoci pohuma kwithsa wao karo, shime aye pohuma. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Munu aa roera ku shima Nyambi ko mucima wenthzi ouhe no mathsaano enthzi oahe nokoro wenthzi ouhe, no ku shima muenthzenthzi eci edi a cishima thsinda. Ethzo mirao thzikuru mu thsivaka kupita nupu mutumbi thzothzihe thzo ku tumekera pofoci neyambero yoihe.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu wa monine ci wa tawire konyanyami, wa mu amberire ci: “Ko di kokure no Kutumina kwa Nyambi.” Ku tunda apo kwithsa munu oyu wa keshukire ku mwipura thsimweya.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Krisitu ne mwana edye?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yesu ou a rongithsire mu Tembere, wa wepurire ci: “Ine eyi a na amberanga arongithsi o murao ci Mesiya po mwana Davida? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Ngeci Davida aye thsinda ko ku tangereriwa ku Mupepo Oukenu wa ambire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Fumu wa amberire Fumu wange ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“O wikare ku rudyo rwange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">shime ku ka kuma apa na ku pakera akwethzimbo yoe kushi thzedyato yoe.” ’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />“Davida aye thsinda aa mwithsa ci Fumu, ngepi karo edi nga ekara mwanenthzi.” Mbunga thzothzikuru thza mu teererire ko thsinyanyu.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa shomorora arongithsi o murao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesu o ku rongithsa wa ambire ci: “Mu mamere arongithsi o murao, aa thzimbanga ku endaura o kwa na vata evata yoire no ku fota ku vumeneniwa mu maurithsero. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Awa anu awo aa shima epura yoikuru mu thsivaka mu masinagoge, no mandau o direma pedika. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Aethzeranga mafakathzi etere yo mu manthzio o ko mahetaheta o ku wa tenderanga erombero yoire. Humbithso thzo kenge thza kwikara thzothzikuru nene.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nupu thza difakathzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu wekarire po pepi no kakoño mu Tembere, wa tanekerire mbunga edi thza konthzeriremo madi. Afumanyi owangi a konthzeriremo madi oangi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Kwa keyire difakathzi o hepwe, wa na konthzeriremo tuwayawaya twidi.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yesu wethsire erongwa yenthzi no ku i ambera ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci oyu difakathzi o hepwe o na konthzera oangi kupita wahe awa a na konthzera omu mu kakoño. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Inene wahe shime a na shimbanga pa rufumo rwo oru ru na piri ku konda. Unone aye muhepwe wenthzi, o na ka cikothsora kokahe apa nga aa yoyera.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa amba yo ku umburuka kwa Yerusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu o ku tunda mu Tembere, thsimweya kwirongwa yenthzi thsa mu amberire ci: “Murongithsi, o mone owa oa mawe nokuru weyi eumba?”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Eyi eumba o mona yoshokuru kenge ya ku umburuka. Kwithsa shaanga diwe dyofoci edi dya ku thsiara peuru thzedi dimweya.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emonithso yo kupwa ko kaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu ou a kekarire pa Mukinya wEtondo yo Miywera, oshungashunga no Tembere, Peturu, Jakovo na Johani na Andereasi a mwipurire ku mukunda ci: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“O tu tongwere, diyuwa dipi ya ku tendahara eyo? Karo thsimonithso mwine ethsi thsa ku monithsa ci yoihe eyi pepi i di no ku tendahara?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Mu mamere ci munu katere a ku miangere, <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />inene owangi kenge mba keya mu dithzina dyange no ku amba ci: ‘Yame no Mesiya,’ karo kenge mbangera owangi. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ou mwa ku yuva yo mamvo no mapurwatwi o mamvo, mwa ku cithzekera. Eyo po yo i na roera ku tendahara, unone kadi kodiyo kupwa ko kaye. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Matunga kenge a ku cirwithsa, no kutumina kenge kwa ku rwithsa kutumina kumweya. Kenge kwa kwikara kungangama ko kaye mu mandau oangi, no mandombo kengeyo. Ao po odiyo matatekero o makando.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Unone amwe mu ciroithsere, inene anu kenge a ku mi twara ku makuta, no ku mi fura mu masinagoge. Kenge a ku mi twara ku manguvuru no mafumu mukaci kange, ci mu ka pe ombangi ku kwo. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Muthzimbu Ouwa waa roera ku hongiwa tango mu matunga oahe. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Ou a ku mi kwata no ku mi twara ku ka mi thzekithsa, mwa ku cithzekera ci ine eyi mu ka amba. Mwa ku ka ambe pohuma eyi mwa ku ka piwa mwethso thsikati, inene kadi yamwe mwa ku ka amba, unone Mupepo Oukenu.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />“Mukurwamunu kenge a ku omba minenthzi ci a paiwe, no tatawamunu kenge a ku omba mwanenthzi. Ana kenge a ku rwithsa ashemi wo no ku wa paithsa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Anu wahe kenge a ku mi thzimba mukaci ko dithzina dyange, unone oyu wa ku ootera shime ku ka kuma ku mahurerero kenge a ku yoyithsiwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Makando oakuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24.15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Ou mwa ku mona ‘omango<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9.27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11.31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12.11</ref>.</char></note> o kupiterera o kwipithsa’ o ku u di mu ndau omu u na kana ku roera kwikara, (oyu tara a nangure), apo honi awa a di mu Judea a ku cirere ku mikinya. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Oyu di pa thsituwa thso nthzio a ku shiruka kwingena mu nthzio ci a ka shimbemo thsimweya. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Noyu di ku dikanda ka a ku twethsa ku huka ku diumbo ci a ka shimbe thsikoveyo thsenthzi. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Mayuwane othsimo wambuyama awa kwikara poremu nowa a ku yamwithsa mwao mayuwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Mu rombere kwa Nyambi ci eyo katere ya ku tendahare pa kufu. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Inene mwao mayuwa kenge kwa kwikara dikarara dyo kuninga ci dya diyerire dikarako ku tunda apa omberire Nyambi enu yoihe, karo mbera ka dikarako. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Napoci Fumu ku tepurura kwao mayuwa, nga kwithsa oyu wa ku para. Unone mukaci kowa na a hangura, na a tepurura kwao mayuwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Mwao mayuwa ngeci munu waa ku mi ambere ci: ‘O mone, Krisitu oya kuya!’ nji ci ‘Ono kuno!’ Mwa ku i tawa. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Inene akrisitu o mbango nakwakukethza o mbango kenge a ku keya no ku na kwama emonithso nekomokithsa kwangera owangi, mane shaanga awa na a hangura Nyambi, nga ayopo i tawa. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Mu mamere ne honi! Ni na mi tongwera enu yoihe o ku i shime ku tendahara!<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukeya kwa Mwana Munu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Unone mwao mayuwa, munyima thzao makando,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">“ ‘diyuwa kenge dya ku nyora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">no ngonda ka thza kwikara no mwethzi,<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />matungwethzi kenge a ku wa ku wiru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">neyi yoshokoro yo mu wiru kenge ya ku ngangamithsiwa.’<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />“Kethsiya thsikati anu kenge a ku mona Mwana Munu o ku keya mu mavui kokoro oukuru no kutethzima. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Karo kenge a ku tuma tungeru twenthzi ku waneka anuenthzi awa na a hangura, ku tunderera mu mandau ane oahe o kaye. Ku tunda ku hura thzo kaye shime ku ka kuma ku hura thzo diwiru.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa yo thsitondo thsokuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Uno honi mu cirongithse thsimweya pa thsitondo thsokuyu. Mite thzathso kamona thziotopa no ku hoka mamuna oape, mu dimuke ci thsikati thso mvura pepi thsi di. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Mweyo, ou mwa ku mona eyo o ku i tendahara, mu dimuke ci kukeya kwenthzi pepi ku di, mane pa thsero. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci mukuta o rerodino ka wa ku pwa shime yoihe eyi o ku i na tendahara. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Diwiru no kaye kenge ya ku pwa, unone maywi ange mbera ka a pu.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwithsa oyu na dimuka edyo diyuwa nji ethso thsikati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24.36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Kwithsa oyu na dimuka edyo diyuwa nji ethso thsikati, shaanga tungeru to mu wiru, shaanga Mwana, shime Tata pohuma yofoci yo na i dimuka. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Pakuninga ci ka mu dimukire thsikati, mu taterere no ku ciroithsera!<verse eid="MRK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />“Kwaa cipitura eci munu oyu di mu ruendo. Aa thsia nthzio thzenthzi no ku pa okoro apikenthzi. Aa pa munu no munu ekwama, no ku raerera mukwakunyunga pa thsero ci a kuñwere. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Mweyo, mu kuñwere, inene ka mu dimukire thsikati ethsi a ku ka huka thsinda thsa nthzio, nji kenge ya kwikara runguro, nji pa kaci kothsiku, nji ñombwe o kwiya, nji mu ruura. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Kuinashimi ayepo keya ko thsiundumukera, katere a ku na mi wane o ku mu na rara. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Eyi ni mi tongwera, yodiyo ni tongwera anu wahe kuninga ci mu mamere!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Kayongo ko kwipaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Joh 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Shime kwa thsiarire mayuwa edi ci kwikare Thsidika thso Paseka no Makende o kupira Mamene. Akuru o mapurisita narongithsi o murao a fotire thsikati thsothsiwa thso ku kwata Yesu kanthzimbere ci a mwipae. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />A ambire ci: “Twa i tenda mu thsikati thso Thsidika, inene kuinashimi mbunga kenge nga thzi tenda mukwangarakanyi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa wethsiwa thsende mu Betania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Joh 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu o ku di mu Betania ku nthzio thza Simoni wengondwe o ku nekara ku tafure, kwa keyire mbuyama no kakeka ko alabasitere ko thsende o ku nuka nawa no ku tura nene. Wa kuyurire thsingo thzoko kakeka no ku shukumwena thsende pa mutwi wa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Amweya kowa ekarire apo a anthzipire no ku amba ci: “Ine yo ku pethsapethsera oyu thsende? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Oyu thsende nga shime a na urithsiwa madi oangi o ku twethsa ku piterera o ku kwamena munu mu mwaka, no ku a pa ahepwe.” Ngou a anthziperire oyo mbuyama.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Mu mu thsie. Ine eyi mu mu shupera? O na tende enu yoiwa ku kwange. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Ahepwe po kenge mwikarangano thsikati thsothsihe no ku wa kwathsa popahe apa mu na shimena. Unone ame ka mwikaranga nange thsikati thsothsihe. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />O na kwama momuhe omu a na twethsera ku kwamena. O na wethse erama yange thsende, ku i roithsera diyuwa dyo ku i vumbeka, thsikati o ku thsi shime ku kuma. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci kokuhe oku mba u hongiwa Muthzimbu Ouwa mu kaye, oyu mbuyama kenge mba a vurukiwa keyi a na kwama ku kwange.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Judasi aa tawa ku omba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Ngou Judasi Isikariota yumweya werongwa yo dikumi naidi, a thzire kwakuru o mapurisita ku ka ciyuvano edi nga a twethsa ku omba Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />A nyanyukire ou a yuvire eyo, ngou a mu kumbwethzire ku mu pa madi. Judasi wa fotire thsikati thsothsiwa ethsi nga a twethsa ku omba Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Murarero o mahurerero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22.7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Joh 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Mu diyuwa dyo kutanga dyo Thsidika thso Makende o kupira Mamene, apa epaerangire manguana eyambero yo Paseka, erongwa ya Yesu ya mwipurire ci: “Kupi oku o na foto ci tu ka ku roithsereko murarero o Paseka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Wa tumine erongwa idi no ku i ambera ci: “Mu thze mu thsikuña, kenge mu ka cihangana no mukwerume oyu na shimbi kafuma ko meyu, mu ka mu shupwere. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Mu nthzio omu a kengena mu ka tongwere thsinda thsa nthzio ci: ‘Murongithsi aepura ci kupi ku nthzio thzenda oku nga ni dyera Paseka nerongwa yange?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Kenge a ka mi twara mu kapingwethzi kokakuru ko ku koroi aka ka na roithsiwa kare, modiyo mu ka roithsera murarero wetu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Ngou honi eyo erongwa idi ya thzire no ku kengena mu mbongi. Ya ka wanine enu yoihe dyodi a i tongwerire Yesu. Ya ka roithseriremo murarero o Paseka.<figure style="fig" alt="The Passover Meal" file="lb00320b.tif" size="span" loc="Mrk 14:12-20" copy="Knowles" ref="14.12-20">Murarero o Paseka</figure><verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Runguro, Yesu wa kumine nerongwa yo dikumi naidi. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />O kwa dya ku tafure, Yesu wa ambire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci yumweya ku kwenu oyu ni dya nenthzi pano kenge a ni omba.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Erongwa ya cinyengire nene no ku tateka ku mwipura munu no munu ci: “Ene yame nji?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu wa i tawire ci: “Yumweya ku kwenu mwakwa dikumi naidi oyu ni dya nenthzi mu karonga kofoci. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Mwana Munu kenge a ku fa eci dyodi ya ñoriwire keyi yenthzi. Unone o di nothsimo oyu wa ku mu omba! Nga yekarire nawa ci nga ka erekiwire.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Murarero wa Fumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22.14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kor 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />O kwa dya, Yesu wa shimbire dikende, munyima thzo ku di fiyawera, wa di pire erongwa yenthzi no ku amba ci: “Mu shimbe, eyi po erama yange.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Wa shimbire nganja thzo waine no ku kanderera kwa Nyambi. Wa thzi i pire, yoihe ya nwinemo. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Wa i amberire ci: “Ou po onyinga wange o thsiyuvano thsa Nyambi nanuenthzi, ou wa ku mwaarera owangi. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci ka na ku nwa waine karo shime mu diyuwa edi na ku mu nwa ope mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ou a manine kwimba dimbo dyo kushangara, a thzire ku Mukinya wEtondo yo Miywera.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu a okethza ya Peturu ci kenge a mu hamura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Joh 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />O kwa di mu dikuñwa, Yesu wa i amberire ci: “Mwahe kenge mwa ku ni yeuka. Inene mu Mañoro ku na ñoriwa ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">‘Kenge na kwipaa mudithsani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">no mangu kenge a ku panthzaana.’<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />“Unone munyima thzo kupinduka kwange kwafu, kenge na ku citangethza ku Galilea.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Peturu wa ambire ci: “Shaanga aenthzange wahe wa cire ku ku thsia, ame ka ni ku thsii!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Peturu, naa ku tongwera yoshemwa ci o uno othsiku, ñombwe o ku shime kwiya rwidi, owe o ku na ni hamura ruhatu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Unone Peturu wa tanarithsire ku amba ci: “Shaanga ku fa kenge na ku fa noe, ka na ku ku hamura!” Namweya wahe a ambire kengeyo.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa rombera mu Getesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Ngou a thzire ku ndau ethzi thzi nethsiwa Getesemani. Yesu wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Mwikare pano, uno ni ka rombera.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Wa shimbire Peturu, Jakovo no Johani no ku thzano. Wa mwingenenine wowa no ku cithzekera. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Wa wa amberire ci: “Mucima wange mu mathsiwa oakuru u di ku ninga ci mane eci nene ni fe. Mwikare apa, mu kuñwere nange.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Ou a wa thsiire kamanana, wa furumanine pashi no ku rombera ci: “Ngeci yaa tawa ethsi thsikati thso makando thsa keya ku kwange.” <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />“Aba, Tata, waa twethsa enu yoihe. O tundithse ethzi nganja thzo dikando ku kwange. Shaanga kengeyo, o tende omu o na fotera owe, kadi omu ni na fotera ame.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ou a ka hukire kwirongwa yenthzi, wa na i wanine o ku i na rara. Wa amberire Peturu ci: “Simoni, epo o na rara? Waa kwanga ku kuñwera shaanga thsitunde thsofoci? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Mu kuñwere no ku rombera ci katere mu were mwiereka. Mupepo waa shima, unone erama yaa faratera.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Yesu wa hukire karo ku ka rombera eci edi a romberire pa kutanga. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Ou a ka hukire, wa na wa wanine o kwa na rara karo, inene meho o shime a remine nene, ka dimukire neyi yo ku mu tawa.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ou a ka hukire ro muthsihatu, wa i amberire ci: “Epo no pano tu di shimbi mwa rarera no ku turumwithsa? Ku na kwana! Thsikati thsi na kumu. Mu mone, Mwana Munu aa ombiwa no ku piwa mu moko anu wevi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Mu katuke tu thzenu! Mukwa ku ni omba o na kumu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa kwatiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Joh 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Popo Yesu o ku amba eyo, Judasi, yumweya ko iya erongwa yo dikumi naidi wa kumine. Shime a keyire no thsipani thsanu awa shimbire myere no miramu, awa tumine akuru o mapurisita, arongithsi o murao nakuru o mbunga. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Judasi aye mukwa ku mu omba, shime a wa pire thsidimukithso ci: “Mukwerume oyu ni ka yamwa yodiyo, mu ka mu kwate no ku mu twara o ku mu thza o mu nyunga ci katere omboroke.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Popa a ka kumine Judasi wa ka thzerererire kwa Yesu, no ku amba ci: “Murongithsi!” no ku mu yamwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />A kwatire Yesu no ku mwanga. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Yumweya kowa ekarire na Yesu wa shwamunine mwere wenthzi, no ku teta ditwi dya mupika mupurisita shokuru.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Ene no thsikeremi eyi mu na ni keyera no myere no miramu ku na nianga? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Ine eyi na mu kana ku nianga uya na nikaranga nenu mu Tembere o ku ni rongithsa diyuwa no diyuwa. Unone eyi ya tendahara ci i citombore neyi ya ñoriwire mu Mañoro keyi yange.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Popo erongwa ya Yesu yoihe ya cirire no ku mu thsia yofoci. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Kwekarire mushumba yumweya oyu wa shupwerire Yesu, o ku na cianga thsinduva thso lineni. A fotire ku mu kwata, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />unone ou a cipothsorire, wa thsiire mu moko o ethso thsinduva thso lineni a ciangire, no ku cira thsisheshe.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa twariwa mu Nthzango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26.57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22.54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Joh 18.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />A twarire Yesu kwa mupurisita shokuru, oku a ciwanawanenine akuru o mapurisita wahe, nakuru o mbunga, narongithsi o murao. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Peturu wa shupwerire Yesu o ku enderanga kokure shime ku nengena mu dirapa dya mupurisita shokuru. Ngou ekarire pofoci nakwakunyunga ku yota mudiro.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Akuru o mapurisita pofoci no Nthzango thzothzihe a fotire ombangi ou nga twethsa ku ratwera Yesu kufa, unone ka u wanine. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Anu owangi a pire o mbangi o mbango ku mu capa, unone ombangi wo ka wa endererire. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Ngou kwemanine akwerume amweya no ku pa ombangi o mbango. <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />A ambire ci: “Na tu mu yuvu o ku amba ci: ‘Kenge na ku umburura ethzi Tembere thza umbiwire ko moko anu, kenge na ku umba thzathzo mu mayuwa ahatu thzo kukana ku umba ko moko anu.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Unone napo karo ombangi wo ka wa endererire.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Ngou mupurisita shokuru emanine mu kaciko no kwipura Yesu ci: “Ene ko i di eyi o na foto ku huthsako? Ine eyi o na foto ku ciambera othsinda kweyi a ku capa awa anu?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Unone Yesu wa tutwarire, ka a tawire thsimweya. Ngou mupurisita shokuru a mwipurire karo ci: “Ene yowe o Krisitu, Mwana Nyambi Shathsiyauthzi?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Yame! Kenge mba mu mona Mwana Munu o ku nekara ku dyoko dyo rudyo dya Nyambi Shokoro ouhe. Karo kenge mba mu mu mona o ku keya mu mavui o ku wiru.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Mupurisita shokuru wa yaturire ekoveyo yenthzi no ku amba ci: “Ombangi wine karo tu fota? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Mu na i ciyuvera mwahe o ku yengwera Nyambi. Amwe ne mwa i mona ngepi?” Wahe a kumbire ci: “Nepithsa, aa roera ku fa!”<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Ngou amweya a tatekire ku mu thsipera mate no ku mu anga thsito pa meho, a mu furire no mafaindi no ku amba ci: “O ukethze oyu na ku furu ci edye,” Akwakunyunga nawo, a mu shimbire o kwa ka thza o mu vakaura mambanda.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peturu aa hamura Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Joh 18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Peturu o ku di mushi mu dirapa, yumweya kwambuyamaana kwapika mupurisita shokuru wa keyire. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Ou a monine Peturu o ku yota ku mudiro, wa mu kengererire thsithzui no ku amba ci: “Nowe shime wa ekaranga na Yesu o ku Nazareta.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Unone Peturu wa hamurire ci: “Ka ni dimukire nji ku yuvithsithsa eyi o amba ci ine.” Ngou a thzire ku mengeneno. Popo ñombwe weyire.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Oyu mbuyamaana ou a mu monineko, wa amberire awa emanine apo karo ci: “Oyo mukwerume oyo naye wa mu thsipani thso.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Peturu wa hamurire karo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Munyima thzo thsikati thsothsipu, awa emanine pepi nenthzi a mu amberire ci: “Yoshemwa nowe o mukwa thsipani thsenthzi, inene nowe o Mugalilea.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Unone wa tatekire kwethza ngoro no ku amba ci: “Na diyerire ame ku mu dimuka oyu munu mu tongora ci edye.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Popo ñombwe weyire ro muthsidi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:72">Ngou honi Peturu a vurukire eyi a mu amberire Yesu ci: “Ñombwe o ku shime kwiya ro muthsidi kenge o ni hamura miendo thzihatu ci ko ni dimuka.” Ngou a cithziururire ku dira.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Pilatu aa ratura Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Joh 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Popa dya vire diyuwa, akuru o mapurisita nakuru o mbunga, arongithsi o murao no Nthzango thzothzihe a ciyuvire. Angire Yesu no ku mu twara ku ka mu pa kwa nguvuru Pilatu.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilatu wepurire Yesu ci: “Ene yowe o fumu o Majuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Aye wa tawire ci: “Ii, dyodi o amba yame!”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Akuru o mapurisita ngou a mu capire enu yoingi ci yo naa kwama. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilatu wa mwipurire karo ci: “Ene kwithsa ethsi o huthsako? O na yuvu eyi enu pongi a ku capa!” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Unone Yesu ka a mu tawire thsimweya, eyo ya komokithsire nene Pilatu.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa ratweriwa kufa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Joh 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Ko murao wo, mwaka no mwaka pa thsidika thso Paseka Pilatu shime a wa rukurwerangire thsinthzinda thsothsihe ethsi a na rombo. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Kowa ekarire mu kamenga mwethso thsikati mukaci ko kwipaa munu mu mukwangarakanyi o ku pirukera kutumina, kwekarire mukwerume o dithzina dyo Barabasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Mbunga thza keyire kwa Pilatu no ku mu romba ci a tende eci edi a wa kwamenangire.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilatu wepurire ci: “Ene mwaa fota ci ni mi punithsere fumu o Majuda?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Wepurire kengeyo pakuninga ci wa dimukire ci akuru o mapurisita shime a retire Yesu ku kwenthzi pa ku mu tendera mbamba. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Unone akuru o mapurisita a hongaurire mbunga ci thzi rombe Pilatu ku wa punithsera Barabasi kadi wao. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Ngou Pilatu a wepurire karo ci: “O mu na foto ci ni tende ngepi oyu mu nethsanga ci fumu o Majuda?”<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus before Pontius Pilate" file="cn01828c.tif" size="col" loc="Mrk 15:9-15" copy="Cook" ref="15.9-15">Yesu pa meho a Pilatu</figure><verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Awo a kumbire ci: “O mwambe pa mbinda!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilatu wepurire ci: “Ine eyi na epithsa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Unone a kumbire wahe karo ko ku tanarithsa ci: “O mwambe pa mbinda!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilatu pa ku fota ku nyanyukithsa mbunga, wa wa punithserire Barabasi. Ngou a tuminine ci Yesu a furiwe no ku u wa pa ci a ka mwambe pa mbinda.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mashwarare o Maroma aa teurura Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Joh 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Mashwarare a twarire Yesu mu marombe omu a tungire nguvuru, no kwithserako mashwarare oahe. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />A vatekire Yesu thsikoveyo thso muvara o muhombohombo, no ku thzinga dikata dyo miunga no ku di mu shupeka ku mutwi. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />A tatekire ku mu showerera ci: “Shooshoo Fumu o Majuda!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />A mu hukahukerire ku mu fura no dingondo ku mutwi no ku mu thsipaera mate. A tongamine ku manwi ku mu varaera ku mu rombera. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ou a manine ku mu varaera, a mu shupurire thsikoveyo thso muvara o muhombohombo no ku mu shupeka ekoveyo yenthzi. Ngou a mu twarire ku ka mwamba pa mbinda.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu a ambiwa pa mbinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Joh 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />A hanganine mukwerume o ku Sirene o dithzina dyo Simoni, tata wa Alekisanda na Rufusi, o ku ka tunda ku makanda. A mu ooterire ku shimba mbinda thza Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />A twarire Yesu pa ndau ethzi thzi nethsiwa Gologota (kuamba ci “Ndau thzo Katendere”). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />A mu pire waine o ku vandakana no muthzi ou u nethsiwa mira, unone Yesu ka a mu nwine.<verse eid="MRK 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ngou a mwambire pa mbinda. A ciererire evata yenthzi ko ku pepa ñera ci a mone ci munu no munu thsipi a shimba. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Nedi mathsikuthsiku ko thsikati thso 9 ou a mwambire pa mbinda. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Maywi o murandu ou a mwipaerire a ñoriwire kenge ci: “Fumu o Majuda.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />A mwamberire mu kaci ko mapuku edi, dimweya ku rudyo dimweya ku rumoho. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Eyi, ya tendaharire ci i citombore no Mañoro o kuninga ci: “Aa mu varera kwikeremi.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Nowa pitire po pepi a mu yengwerire o kwa nyunga mitwi thzo no ku amba ci: “Ewa, owe o ku twethsa ku umburura Tembere no ku thzi umba mu mayuwa ahatu, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />o ciyoyithse othsinda. O shirukepo apo pa mbinda!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Mofoci kengeyo nakuru o mapurisita narongithsi o murao, a mu varaerire mu kaciko. A ambire ci: “Naa yoyithsa amweya, unone aye aa kwanga ku ciyoyithsa! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Oyu Krisitu Fumu o Maisiraele a shiruke honi pa mbinda, ci tu mone no ku tawa.” Nowa ambiwire nenthzi a mu teururire.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Joh 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Diyuwa ou dya kumine pa kaci ko mutwi, mirema thza thsikire ditunga dyodihe mwitunde ihatu katere ku ka kuma mu thsikati thso muthsihatu thso runguro. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ko thsikati thso muthsihatu thso runguro Yesu wa dirire ko diywi dyodikuru ci: “Eloi, Eloi lama sabakatani?” ku amba ci: “Nyambi wange, Nyambi wange, waa ni thsiererera ine?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Ou a i yuvire amweya awa emanine po pepi aa ambire ci: “Mu na yuvu, aethsa Eliya!” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Mukwerume yumweya wa ndandumukire ku ka shimba thsiponji no ku thsi cimbeka mu waine o kuwawata, wa thsi pakire ku dimbungu no ku pa Yesu ci a nwe, no ku amba ci: “Mu mu thsie tu mone ngeci oyu Eliya ethsa kenge a keya ku na mu tundithsa pa mbinda.”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yesu wa karumukire ko diywi dyodikuru no ku mina mwoyo ku fa. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Popo dimbatu dyo mu Tembere dya yaturiwire epinthzi idi, ku tatekera ku wiru katere pashi.<figure style="fig" alt="Temple curtain torn top to bottom" file="gt00041b.tif" size="col" loc="Mrk 15:33-41" copy="Gordon" ref="15.33-41">Dimbatu dyo mu Tembere dyaa yatuka ku tatekera ku wiru katere pashi</figure><verse eid="MRK 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma oyu wemanine pa rupara rwa Yesu, ou a mu yuvire o ku dira no ku mona oku fa, wa ambire ci: “Yoshemwa oyu mukwerume po nedi Mwana Nyambi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Ambuyama amweya shime a i tanekerire o kwa nemana kokure. Mu kaciko, kwekarire Madiya Magadalena, Madiya mama wa Jakovo shoonye na Josesi, na Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Yesu o ku di mu Galilea, awa ambuyama awa a mu shupwerire no ku mu kwamena. Ambuyama amweya owangi awa a keyire nenthzi ku Yerusalema nawo pekarire.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa vumbekiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joh 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Apo nedi runguro, mu Diyuwa dyOciroithsero, dyo Savata o ku di shime ku tateka. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Josefa o ku Arimatea oyu wekarire o mukuru mu thsivaka mu Nthzango thzo Majuda, karo oyu wa tatererire Kutumina kwa Nyambi, wa thzire kondume kwa Pilatu no ku ka romba erama ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilatu wa komokire ou a yuvire ci Yesu o na fu kare. Wethsire muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma, wa mwipurire ci Yesu ne o na fu kare nji ngepi. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Ou a yuvire kwa muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma ci Yesu o na fu, wa tawethzire Josefa ku ka shimba thsithzimbi thsa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Josefa wa urire dimbatu dyodikenu dyo lineni, wamburire thsithzimbi thsa Yesu pa mbinda no ku thsivungera omo mu dimbatu. Wa thsi pakire mu thsidi ethsi thsa cakuriwire mu diwe. Ngou arumwenine diwe ku thsero thzathso. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Madiya Magadalena no Madiya mama wa Josesi, a monine omu a pakiwire Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="rem">TC, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa pinduka kwafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Joh 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Ou dya pwire diyuwa dyo Savata, Madiya Magadalena no Madiya mama wa Jakovo, no Salome a urire ehefu ci a ka wethse erama ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Diyuwa dyo kutanga mu sunda mathsikuthsiku diyuwa o ku di va, a thzire ku thsidi. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Mu dikuñwa a cipurire ci: “Edye oyu ka tu arumwena diya diwe dyo ku thsero thzo thsidi?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Unone ou a kamburire meho, a monine ci diya diwe dyodikuru nene di na arumuniwako kare.<verse eid="MRK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ou engenine mu thsidi, a yapire nene ou a monine mushumba oyu wa vatire thsivata thsothsire thso kuvyakima, o ku nekara ku rudyo rwo. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Wa wa amberire ci: “Mwa yapa! Mwaa fota Yesu o ku Nazareta oyu naa ambiwa pa mbinda. O na pinduka kwafu! Ka a dimo muno, mu mone apa na mu paka. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Unone mu thze, mu ka tongwere erongwa yenthzi no Peturu ci o na citangethza ku Galilea. Kodiyo mu ka mu monena eci diya naa mi tongwera.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Awo ambuyama ngou a punine no ku cira ku thsidi, inene a yapire no ku tutuma. Mukaci ko ku yapa nene, ka tongwerire munu thsimweya.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa hokoka kwa Madiya Magadalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Joh 20.11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />[Mu diyuwa dyo kutanga mu sunda mathsikuthsiku, Yesu ou a pindukire kwafu, wa tangire ku hokoka kwa Madiya Magadalena oya a tundithsire mathzimu o mutanu na edi. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Madiya wa thzire no ku ka tongwera awa ekarangire na Yesu awa ciyuvire mathsiwa no ku dira. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Unone ou a yuvire ci Yesu po muyumi karo o na mu mono, ka i tawire.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa hokoka kwirongwa yenthzi idi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24.13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Munyima thzeyo, Yesu wa hokokire mu thsihanga thsathso kwirongwa idi kwirongwa yenthzi o kwa tunda mu thsikuña thsa Yerusalema ku thza ku maumbo. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />A hukire no ku ka tongwera amweya, unone nawo ka ka wa tawire.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa hokoka kwirongwa yo dikumi na yofoci</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Joh 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ete 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Munyima thzo ku pinduka kwenthzi, Yesu wa hokokire kwirongwa yo dikumi na thsofoci o ku i dya. Wa i kutururire pa kupira kwayo thsitawo no mukanayuva wayo, inene ya kanine ku tawa eyi a i tongwerire awa a mu monine munyima thzo ku pinduka kwenthzi kwafu.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Wa wa amberire ci: “Mu thze mu kaye kokahe mu ka honge mishovo thzothzihe Muthzimbu Ouwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Yomuhe oyu wa ku tawa no ku korovethziwa kenge a ku yoyithsiwa, unone yomuhe o kukana ku tawa kenge a ku raturiwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Awa a ku tawa kenge a ku twethsa ku kwama emonithso yoikuru. Ko dithzina dyange kenge a ku cithza mathzimu no ku amba madimi oape, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />kenge a ku kwata mayoka no moko, karo shaanga wa ku nwe ndambyekera ka ya ku wa retera okaru. Kenge a ku kambeka moko peuru thzakwakukora karo kenge a ku pora.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa huka ku wiru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24.50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Ete 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Fumu Yesu ou a manine ku ambaurano, wa shimbiwire ku twariwa mu wiru no ku kekara ku dyoko dyo rudyo dya Nyambi. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Erongwa ngou ya thzire no ku ka honga Muthzimbu Ouwa kokuhe. Fumu wa kwamineno ku tanarithsa diywi dyenthzi ko ku wa pa okoro o ku kwama emonithso eyi ya endererire nadyo.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>